<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Luo Translation 2020</book>
  <para style="h">1 Ruodhi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruodhi Mokwongo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ruodhi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ruo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ruodhi Mokwongo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Adonija oketore kende kaka ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1"/>Kane Ruoth Daudi oseti kendo hike ne ngʼeny, kata ne oume gi lep nindo to ne ok onyal yudo liet. <verse eid="1KI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2"/>Omiyo wasumbinige nowachone niya, “Yie iwe wadwar nyako matin ma pod ok oriwore gi dichwo mondo orit ruoth kendo otine, bende onyalo nindo e bath Ruoth mondo ruodhwa obed maliet.”<verse eid="1KI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3"/>Eka negimanyo ei piny Israel duto nyako ma jaber mine giyudo Abishag nyar Shunam mine gikele ni ruoth. <verse eid="1KI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4"/>Nyakono ne ber ahinya kendo norito ruoth kotiyone to kata kamano ruoth ne ok oriwore kode kaka dhako.<verse eid="1KI 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5"/>Koro Adonija ma min-gi niluongo ni Hagith noyiedhore mowacho niya, “Abiro bedo ruoth.” Omiyo noiko geche kod farese kod joidh farese piero abich mondo oring e nyime. <verse eid="1KI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6"/>Wuon mare ne pok otale kata penje niya, “En angʼo momiyo itimo kamano?” Bende ne en gi chia kendo nonywole koluwo bangʼ Abisalom.<verse eid="1KI 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7"/>Adonija noloso gi Joab wuod Zeruya kod Abiathar jadolo mine gimiye lwedo. <verse eid="1KI 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8"/>To Zadok jadolo gi Benaya wuod Jehoyada gi Nathan janabi gi Shimei gi Rei gi jarit Daudi ne ok oriwore gi Adonija.<verse eid="1KI 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9"/>Eka Adonija nochiwo misengini mag rombe gi dhok kod nyiroye machwe ewi kidi mar Zoheleth machiegni gi En Rogel. Nogwelo owetene duto, ma yawuot ruoth kod jodong Juda duto, <verse eid="1KI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10"/>to ne ok ogwelo Nathan janabi, Benaya jarit ruoth kata Solomon owadgi.<verse eid="1KI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11"/>Eka Nathan nopenjo Bathsheba min Solomon niya, “Bende isewinjo ni Adonija wuod Hagith osedoko Ruoth ka Daudi ruodhwa ok ongʼeyo? <verse eid="1KI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12"/>Omiyo koro we angʼadni rieko kaka inyalo konyo ngimani kod ngima Solomon wuodi.” <verse eid="1KI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13"/>Dhi ir Ruoth Daudi kendo penje niya, “Ruodha, donge nisingorina an jatichni kiwacho ni, ‘Adier Solomon wuodi biro bedo ruoth bangʼa kendo obiro bedo e kom duongʼ mara? Ka en kamano, to ere kaka koro Adonija osebedo ruoth?’ <verse eid="1KI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14"/>Kapod in kanyo iwuoyo gi ruoth, abiro donjo kanyo kendo siro weche duto misewacho.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15"/>Omiyo Bathsheba nodhi neno ruoth makoro hike ne ngʼeny e agola mare mar nindo kama Abishag nyar Shunam ne rite. <verse eid="1KI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16"/>Bathsheba nokulore piny mi ogoyo chonge e nyim ruoth.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 1:16">Ruoth nopenje niya, “En angʼo midwaro?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17"/>En to nowacho niya, “Ruodha, in iwuon ema ne isingorina an jatichni e nying Jehova Nyasaye Nyasachi ni, ‘Solomon wuodi enobed ruoth bangʼa kendo enobed e kom duongʼ mara.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18"/>To koro Adonija osebedo ruoth, kendo in, ruodha ok ingʼeyo. <verse eid="1KI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19"/>Osetimo misengini mathoth mag dhok gi nyiroye machwe gi rombe kendo oseluongo yawuot ruoth duto gi Abiathar jadolo gi jatend jolweny to ok oseluongo Solomon jatichni. <verse eid="1KI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20"/>Ruodha, jo-Israel duto ngʼiyi mondo gingʼe kuomini en ngʼa mabiro bedo e kom duongʼ ruodha bangʼe. <verse eid="1KI 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21"/>Ka ok kamano, to ka ruodha osenindo gi kwerene, to an gi wuoda Solomon ibiro kaw kaka joketho.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22"/>Kapod nowuoyo gi ruoth, Nathan janabi nochopo. <verse eid="1KI 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23"/>Kendo neginyiso ruoth niya, “Nathan janabi ni ka.” Kuom mano nodhi e nyim ruoth mi okulore piny auma.<verse eid="1KI 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24"/>Nathan nowachone niya, “Bende in ruodha isechiko ni Adonija biro bedo ruoth bangʼi kendo ni obiro bedo e kom duongʼ? <verse eid="1KI 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25"/>Kawuono osedhi mi ochiwo misengini mathoth mag dhok gi nyiroye machwe kod rombe. Oseluongo yawuot ruoth duto gi jotend lweny kod Abiathar jadolo. E seche ma wawuoyoeni koro gichiemo kendo gimetho kode bende giwacho kama, ‘Ruoth Adonija mondo odag amingʼa!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26"/>To an jatichni gi Zadok jadolo gi Benaya wuod Jehoyada gi jatichni Solomon ne ok ogwelo. <verse eid="1KI 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27"/>Bende ma dibed gimoro malingʼ-lingʼ ma ruodha osetimo ka ok onyiso jotichne ngʼama onego bed e kom loch mar ruodha bangʼe?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oketo Solomon ruoth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28"/>Eka Ruoth Daudi nowacho niya, “Luongna Bathsheba.” Kuom mano nobiro mochungʼ e nyime.<verse eid="1KI 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29"/>Bangʼ mano ruoth nokwongʼore kowacho niya, “Adier akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ma oseresa e chandruok duto, <verse eid="1KI 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30"/>ni kawuono abiro timo gima ne akwongʼorani gi nying Jehova Nyasaye, Nyasach Israel ni anatim: Kamano Solomon wuodi biro bedo ruoth bangʼa kendo obiro bedo e kom lochna.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31"/>Eka Bathsheba nokulore piny auma nyaka e lowo ka ogoyo chonge piny e nyim ruoth kowacho niya, “Mad ruodha Daudi Jaloch dag amingʼa!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32"/>Ruoth Daudi nowacho niya, “Luonguru Zadok jadolo gi Nathan janabi kod Benaya wuod Jehoyada.” Kane gibiro e nyim ruoth, <verse eid="1KI 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33"/>nowachonegi niya, “Kauru jotich ruoth kodu kendo keturu Solomon wuoda e punda awuon kendo tereuru Gihon. <verse eid="1KI 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34"/>Kanyo ema inyis Zadok jadolo gi Nathan janabi ni gibiro wire obed Ruoth ewi Israel duto. Gouru atungʼ turumbete kukok ni, ‘Ruoth Solomon obed mangima amingʼa!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35"/>Eka unudhi kode kendo enobi mi obedi e kom lochna mondo olochi kara. Asekete jatelo kuom jo-Israel kod jo-Juda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36"/>Benaya wuod Jehoyada nodwoko ruoth niya, “Amin! Mad Jehova Nyasaye, Nyasach ruodha ma jaloch otime kamano. <verse eid="1KI 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37"/>Kaka Jehova Nyasaye ne nigi ruodha ma jaloch, mad obed gi Solomon koketo lochne obedo maduongʼ moloyo loch ruodha Daudi Jaloch!”<verse eid="1KI 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38"/>Omiyo Zadok jadolo gi Nathan janabi gi Benaya wuod Jehoyada ja-Kereth kod jo-Peleth nodhi mi oketo Solomon e punda Daudi ruoth mi gikowe nyaka Gihon. <verse eid="1KI 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39"/>Zadok jadolo nokawo tungʼ mar mo e Hema Maler mi nowiro Solomon. Eka negigoyo turumbete kendo ji duto nogoyo koko niya, “Ruoth Solomon mondo odag amingʼa!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40"/>Kendo ji duto nowuotho kaluwo bangʼe ka gigoyo asili kendo gimor mathoth mi piny noyiengni.<verse eid="1KI 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41"/>Adonija gi welo duto mane ni kode nowinjo kokono kane gitieko nyasigi. Kane giwinjo ywak mar turumbete Joab nopenjo niya, “Tiend koko magore e dalano to en angʼo?”<verse eid="1KI 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42"/>To kane pod owuoyo kamano, Jonathan wuod Abiathar jadolo nochopo. Adonija nowachone niya, “Donji, ngʼat mowinjore kaka in nyaka bed ni okelo wach maber.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43"/>Jonathan nodwoke niya, “Ok kamano ngangʼ! Ruodhwa Daudi oseketo Solomon ruoth. <verse eid="1KI 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44"/>Ruoth oseoro Zadok jadolo, Nathan janabi, Benaya wuod Jehoyada, gi jo-Kereth kod jo-Peleth mi gikete obedo e punda ruoth, <verse eid="1KI 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45"/>kendo Zadok jadolo kod Nathan janabi osewire obedo ruoth e Gihon. Ka gia kanyo gisebedo ka gigoyo koko kendo dala duto mor. Mano e koko ma uwinjo. <verse eid="1KI 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46"/>Moloyo mano, Solomon osebedo e kome mar ruoth. <verse eid="1KI 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47"/>Bende jodong ruoth duto osebiro mondo opwo ruodhwa Daudi kagiwacho ni, ‘Mad Nyasachi ket nying Solomon bed gi huma moloyo mari kendo kom ruodhe dok maduongʼ moloyo mari!’ Kendo ruoth nokulore e kitandane kamiye duongʼ <verse eid="1KI 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48"/>kowacho ni, ‘Pak obed ne Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel mosemiyo wangʼa oneno ngʼama okawo lochna kawuono.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49"/>Gikanyono wend Adonija duto nochungʼ malo gi bwok kendo ne gike. <verse eid="1KI 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50"/>Luoro nomako Adonija nikech Solomon, omiyo nodhi momako tunge mag kendo mar misango. <verse eid="1KI 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51"/>Eka Solomon nonyisi niya, “Adonija oluoro ruoth Solomon kendo omako tunge mag kendo mar misango. Owacho ni, ‘Ruoth Solomon mondo okwongʼrena kawuono ni ok enoneg jatichne gi ligangla.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52"/>Solomon to nodwoko niya, “Ka timbene onyisore ni en ngʼat makare kata mana yie wiye ok enolwar e lowo; to ka richo oyudi kuome to enotho.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53"/>Eka Ruoth Solomon nooro ji mi gikele koa e kendo mar misango. Adonija nobiro mokulore piny e nyim Ruoth Solomon kendo Solomon nowachone niya, “Dhi dalani.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Daudi siemo Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1"/>Kane kinde ochopo machiegni mondo Daudi otho, nosiemo Solomon wuode.<verse eid="1KI 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2"/>Kowacho niya, “Achiegni dhi kuma ji duto manie piny dhiye.” Omiyo bed motegno kendo jiwri ka dichwo, <verse eid="1KI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3"/>kendo irit gima Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi dwaro: Kiwuotho e yorene kendo irit puonjne gi chikene kod gik moko duto modwaro kaka ondiki e chik Musa mondo idhi nyime maber e gik moko duto mitimo, kendo kamoro amora midhiye, <verse eid="1KI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4"/>eka Jehova Nyasaye nyalo rito singruokne mane omiya ni, Ka nyikwayi onono kaka gidak kendo ka giwuotho gi adiera e nyima gi chunygi duto kod parogi duto to ok nibedi maonge ngʼat manyalo bedo e kom duongʼ e Israel.<verse eid="1KI 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5"/>Koro in iwuon ingʼeyo gima Joab wuod Zeruya notimona, gima notimo ni jotend lweny ariyo mag Israel, Abner wuod Ner gi Amasa wuod Jetha. Ne onegogi, kochwero rembgi e ndalo kwe mana ka ndalo mag lweny kendo remono nomienogo okandane mane otweyo e nungone kod wuochene manie tiendene. <verse eid="1KI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6"/>Ti kode kaluwore gi riekoni, to kik iwe lwar mantie e wiye dhi e bur gi kwe.<verse eid="1KI 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7"/>To bed mangʼwon ni yawuot Barzilai ja-Gilead kendo we gibed achiel kuom joma chiemo e mesani. Negidok jokora kane aringo e nyim Abisalom owadu.<verse eid="1KI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8"/>Bende par, ni nitie Shimei wuod Gera, ja-Benjamin moa Bahurim mane okwongʼa malit kane adhi Mahanaim. Kane obiro romona e dho Jordan, ne akwongʼorane gi nying Jehova Nyasaye niya, Ok ananegi gi ligangla. <verse eid="1KI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9"/>To koro kik ikwane ka ngʼama onge ketho. In ngʼama riek; iningʼe gima nitimne. Kik iwe lwar mantie e wiye dhi e bur gi kwe.<verse eid="1KI 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10"/>Eka Daudi notho gi wuonene kendo noyike e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11"/>Daudi noyudo osetelo ne Israel kuom higni piero angʼwen, ka higni abiriyo ne en Hebron to higni piero adek gadek ka en Jerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12"/>Omiyo Solomon nobet e kom loch wuon mare Daudi, kendo lochne nogurore.<verse eid="1KI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Loch Solomon ogurore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13"/>Koro Adonija wuod Hagith nodhi ir Bathsheba min Solomon. Bathsheba nopenje niya, “Ibiro gi kwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Eka nodwoko niya, “Ee abiro gi kwe.” <verse eid="1KI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14"/>Eka nomedo wacho niya, “An gi wach moro madwaro wachoni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Nodwoko niya, “Inyalo wacho.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15"/>Eka nowacho niya, “Kaka ingʼeyo, pinyruoth ne mara. Jo-Israel duto nongʼiya kaka ruodhgi. To gik moko nolokore ma pinyruoth nodok ni owadwa; nimar Jehova Nyasaye ema osemiyego. <verse eid="1KI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16"/>Koro an gi kwayo achiel madwaro kwayo. Ka iyie to kik itama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Bathsheba nowachone niya, “Wachi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17"/>Eka Adonija nomedo wacho niya, “Yie ikwa ruoth Solomon omiya Abishag nyar Shunam obed jaoda nikech angʼeyo ni ok obi tami.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18"/>Bathsheba to ne odwoke niya, “Mano ber, abiro wuoyoni gi ruoth.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19"/>Kane Bathsheba odhi ir Ruoth Solomon mondo owuo kuom Adonija, ruoth nochungʼ malo mokulorene eka nobet e kome mar duongʼ. Nokwayo mondo okel ni min-gi kom duongʼ eka nobet e bade korachwich.<verse eid="1KI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20"/>Bathsheba nowachone niya, “An-gi kwayo matin madwaro kwayo to yie kik itama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Ruoth to nodwoke niya, “Kwaye akwaya minwa nimar ok anatami.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21"/>Omiyo nowacho niya, “Yie iwe Abishag nyar Shunam mondo okend gi owadu Adonija.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22"/>Ruoth Solomon nodwoko min niya, “Angʼo momiyo ikwayo Abishag nyar Shunam ni Adonija? Inyalo anyala kata mana kwayone pinyruoth nimar en owadwa maduongʼ, bende inyalo kwaye ni Abiathar jadolo kod Joab wuod Zeruya!”<verse eid="1KI 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23"/>Eka Ruoth Solomon nokwongʼore gi nying Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Mad Nyasaye kweda ka Adonija ok otho nikech kwayoni. <verse eid="1KI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24"/>Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni en mosegura e kom loch mar Daudi wuora kendo mosesingo ni nyikwaya pinyruoth ni Adonija nyaka negi kawuono!” <verse eid="1KI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25"/>Omiyo Ruoth Solomon nochiwo chik ne Benaya wuod Jehoyada, mi nonego Adonija.<verse eid="1KI 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26"/>To kuom Abiathar jadolo, ruoth nowacho niya, “Dog e puotheni mantie Anathoth. Iwinjori gi tho, to ok ananegi sani, nikech nitingʼo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto e nyim Daudi wuonwa kendo nineno chandruok duto mane wuonwa oneno.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27"/>Omiyo Solomon nogolo Abiathar e tich dolo mar Jehova Nyasaye kochopogo wach mane Jehova Nyasaye owacho Shilo kuom od Eli.<verse eid="1KI 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28"/>Kane wechego olandore mochopo ni Joab mane joriwore gi Adonija kata obedo ni ne ok oriwore gi Abisalom, ne oringo modhi e Hemb Jehova Nyasaye mi nomako tunge kendo mar misango. <verse eid="1KI 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29"/>Ruoth Solomon nowachne ni Joab oseringo modhi e hemb Jehova Nyasaye kendo ni ne en but kendo mar misango. Eka Solomon nochiko Benaya wuod Jehoyada niya, “Dhiyo mondo inege.”<verse eid="1KI 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30"/>Omiyo Benaya nodonjo e Hemb Jehova Nyasaye kendo nowacho ni Joab niya, “Ruoth wacho ni, ‘Wuog oko!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">To nodwoke niya, “Ooyo, abiro mana tho ka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Benaya nodwoko wach Joab ni ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31"/>Eka ruoth nochiko Benaya niya, “Tim kaka osewacho. Nege kendo yike mondo ipwodha kod od wuonwa kuom richo mar remo makare mane Joab ochwero. <verse eid="1KI 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32"/>Jehova Nyasaye enochule kuom remo mane ochwero, nikech nonego ji ariyo gi ligangla ka wuonwa Daudi kia. Nonego Abner wuod Ner jatend lweny mar Israel kod Amasa wuod Jetha jatend lweny mar Juda mane gin joma ber kendo mobidhore moloye. <verse eid="1KI 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33"/>Mad rembgi obedi ewi Joab gi nyikwaye nyaka chiengʼ. To kuom Daudi gi nyikwaye gi ode kod kuom lochne, mad kwe Jehova Nyasaye obedie nyaka chiengʼ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34"/>Omiyo Benaya wuod Jehoyada nodhi monego Joab kendo noyike mana e lope e thim. <verse eid="1KI 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35"/>Ruoth noketo Benaya wuod Jehoyada jatend lweny kar Joab mi noketo Zadok jadolo kar Abiathar jadolo.<verse eid="1KI 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36"/>Eka ruoth noluongo Shimei ire, mowachone niya, ger ot Jerusalem mondo idagie to kik iwuogi ni idhi kamoro amora. <verse eid="1KI 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37"/>Chiengʼ ma iniwuogi ma ingʼadi Holo mar Kidron, to bed gadiera ni initho; kendo rembi enobed e wiyi.<verse eid="1KI 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38"/>To Shimei nodwoko ruoth niya, “Gima iwacho ber, jatichni biro timo kaka ruodhe osewacho.” Shimei nodak Jerusalem kuom ndalo mangʼeny.<verse eid="1KI 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39"/>To bangʼ higni adek jotich Shimei ariyo noringo modhi ir Akish wuod Maaka, ruodh Gath kendo nowach ne Shimei niya, “Wasumbinigi ni Gath.” <verse eid="1KI 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40"/>Gikanyono noidho pundane kendo nodhi ir Akish kane en Gath komanyo wasumbinige, omiyo Shimei nodhi moduogogi.<verse eid="1KI 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41"/>Kane onyis Solomon ni Shimei nowuok Jerusalem modhi nyaka Gath kendo odwogo, <verse eid="1KI 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42"/>ruoth noluongo Shimei mowachone niya, “Donge ne akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye ka asiemi ni chiengʼ ma iniwuogi mondo idhi kamoro amora to ibed kingʼeyo ni initho? To e kindeno niwachona niya, ‘Gima iwacho ber, abiro luwo.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43"/>Angʼo momiyo ne ok irito singruokni ni Jehova Nyasaye kendo rito chik mane amiyi?”<verse eid="1KI 2:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44"/>Ruoth nomedo wachone Shimei niya, “Ingʼeyo e chunyi richo duto mane itimone wuonwa Daudi. Koro Jehova Nyasaye biro chuli kuom richo duto mane itimo. <verse eid="1KI 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45"/>To Ruoth Solomon ibiro gwedhi kendo kom loch mar Daudi biro siko kogurore e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nyaka chiengʼ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46"/>Eka ruoth nogolo chik ni Benaya wuod Jehoyada, mi nowuok modhi mogoyo Shimei monege.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Pinyruoth koro nogurore e lwet Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 2:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Solomon okwayo rieko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1"/>Solomon notimo winjruok gi Farao ruodh Misri mi nokendo nyare. Nokele e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi nyaka notieko gero ode owuon mar loch kod od Jehova Nyasaye mar lemo gi ohinga molworo Jerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2"/>Ji to pod ne timo misengini e kuonde motingʼore nikech od lemo ne pok oger ni nying Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1KI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3"/>Solomon nonyiso herane ni Jehova Nyasaye kowuotho moluwore gi yore mag Daudi wuon-gi makmana ni notimo misengini kendo nowangʼo ubani kuonde motingʼore.<verse eid="1KI 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4"/>Ruoth nodhi Gibeon mondo ochiw misengini nimar kanyo e kama notingʼore malo moloyo ahinya kendo Solomon nochiwo misengini miwangʼo pep alufu achiel e kendo mar misangono. <verse eid="1KI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5"/>E Gibeon kanyo ema Jehova Nyasaye nofwenyore ni Solomon gotieno e lek kendo Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Kwa gimoro amora midwaro ni mondo amiyi.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6"/>Solomon nodwoko niya, “Isenyiso ngʼwono maduongʼ ni jatichni Daudi wuonwa nikech ne en ja-adiera kuomi kendo ne en ngʼama kare ma chunye odimbore. Bende pod inyise ngʼwono maduongʼno nyaka chil kawuono kendo isemiye wuowi mondo obedi e kome kawuononi.<verse eid="1KI 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7"/>“Koro, yaye Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasacha, iseketo jatichni ruoth kar wuonwa Daudi. To an mana rawera kendo ok angʼeyo kaka onego atim tichna. <verse eid="1KI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8"/>Jatichni nitie ka e kind oganda miseyiero, oganda maduongʼ kendo mathoth mokalo akwana. <verse eid="1KI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9"/>Omiyo mi jatichni chuny mariek mondo otel ne jogi kendo mar pogo ber gi rach. Nimar en ngʼa manyalo telo ni oganda maduongʼ machalo kama?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10"/>Jehova Nyasaye ne mor ni Solomon nokwayo mano. <verse eid="1KI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11"/>Omiyo Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Nikech isekwayo mana ma to ok ikwayo ngima mathoth kata mwandu ni in iwuon, bende ok isekwayo tho mar wasiki to isekwayo mana rieko kuom ngʼado bura kare, <verse eid="1KI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12"/>Abiro timo gima isekwayo. Abiro miyi chuny mar rieko kod mar ngʼeyo mondo kik bedie ngʼama chalo kodi kendo nyaka chiengʼ. <verse eid="1KI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13"/>Moloyo mano abiro miyi nyaka mago ma ok ikwayo kaka mwandu kod duongʼ mondo e kinde mag ngimani ok inibed gi ngʼat maromo kodi e kind ruodhi. <verse eid="1KI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14"/>To kiwuotho e yorena kendo rito buchena kod chikena kaka Daudi wuonu notimo bende anamiyi idak amingʼa.” <verse eid="1KI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15"/>Bangʼe Solomon nochiewo moyudo ni ne en mana lek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:15">Nodok Jerusalem mochungʼ e nyim Sandug Muma mar Singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye kendo nochiwo misango miwangʼo pep kod misango mag lalruok. Eka notimo nyasi ni joge duto manie dala mar ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngʼado bura makare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16"/>Chiengʼ moro mon ariyo ma jochode nobiro ir ruoth mochungʼ e nyime. <verse eid="1KI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17"/>Achiel kuomgi nowacho niya, “Ruodha, dhakoni gi an wadak e ot chiel. Ne ayudo nyathi kane en koda e ot. <verse eid="1KI 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18"/>Chiengʼ mar adek kasenywolo nyathina, dhakoni bende noyudo nyathi. To ne onge ngʼato moro amora e ot makmana wan kendwa.<verse eid="1KI 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19"/>“Gotieno wuod dhakoni notho nikech nonindo kuome. <verse eid="1KI 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20"/>Omiyo nochungʼ malo chuny otieno kendo okaw wuoda e batha ka jatichni ne nindo. Nokete e kore to okawo wuode mothono oketo e kora. <verse eid="1KI 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21"/>Kinyne gokinyi nachungʼ mondo adhodh wuoda to nayudo kotho! To kane anone gi ler mar okinyi ne aneno ni ok en wuowi mane anywolo.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22"/>Dhako machielono nokwer kawacho niya, “Ooyo! Mangimani e wuoda; to mothono e mari.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">To dhako mokwongono notwoyo dhoge kawacho niya, “Ooyo! Wuowi mothono e mari; to mangimano to mara.” Omiyo ne gimino wach e nyim ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23"/>Eka ruoth nowacho niya, “Iwacho ni, ‘Wuoda ngima kendo mari otho,’ kendo machielo wacho ni, ‘Ooyo, wuodi otho to mara ngima.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24"/>Eka ruoth nowacho niya, “Kelna ligangla.” Omiyo negikelone ruoth ligangla. <verse eid="1KI 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25"/>Bangʼe nochiwo chik kowacho niya, “Ngʼaduru nyathi mangimano e diere ariyo eka umi ngʼato ka ngʼato nus.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26"/>Eka dhako mane wuode ngima nokecho wuode mowacho ni ruoth niya, “Kiyie ruodha, miye nyathino mangimano! Kik inege!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">To dhako machielo nowacho niya, “An kata in ok noyud nyathino. Ngʼade nyadiriyo!”<verse eid="1KI 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27"/>Eka ruoth nongʼado bura kama, “Miuru dhako mokwongono nyathi mangima, kik unege nimar en e min-gi.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28"/>Kane jo-Israel owinjo bura mane ruoth ongʼado, negimiyo ruoth duongʼ nikech negineno ne en-gi rieko moa kuom Nyasaye.<verse eid="1KI 3:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Jodong Solomon gi jotelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1"/>Kamano ruoth Solomon nobedo ruodh Israel duto.<verse eid="1KI 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2"/>Magi ema ne jodonge madongo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 4:2"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:2">Azaria wuod Zadok jadolo;<verse eid="1KI 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3"/>Elihoref kod Ahija yawuot Shisha jogoro;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:3">Jehoshafat wuod Ahilud jachan weche.<verse eid="1KI 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4"/>Benaya wuod Jehoyada jatend jolweny.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:4">Zadok kod Abiathar ma jodolo;<verse eid="1KI 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5"/>Azaria wuod Nathan ma jatend jodong gwengʼ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:5">Zabud wuod Nathan jadolo kendo jangʼad ni ruoth rieko;<verse eid="1KI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6"/>Ahishar ma jatend od ruoth;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:6">Adoniram wuod Abda ma jatend tij achune.<verse eid="1KI 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7"/>Solomon bende ne nigi jotelo apar gariyo mane orito pinje manie Israel duto kendo ne choko gik moko ne ruoth kod joge. Moro ka moro kuomgi ne kelo chiemo kuom dwe achiel e higa.<verse eid="1KI 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8"/>Magi e nying-gi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 4:8"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:8">Ben-Hur norito pinje mag gode mag Efraim:<verse eid="1KI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9"/>Ben-Deker norito Makaz; Shalbim, Beth Shemesh kod Elon Bethhanan;<verse eid="1KI 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10"/>Ben-Hesed norito Aruboth (Soko kod pinje duto mag Hefer).<verse eid="1KI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11"/>Ben-Abinadab norito Nafoth Dor (kendo nokendo Tafath ma nyar Solomon).<verse eid="1KI 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12"/>Baana wuod Ahilud norito Tanak, gi Megido nyaka Beth Shan duto machiegni gi Zarethan man mwalo mar Jezreel, koa Beth Shan nyaka Abel Mehola man loka mar Jokmeam.<verse eid="1KI 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13"/>Ben-Geber norito Ramoth Gilead (kod kuonde dak mag Jair wuod Manase man Gilead kaachiel gi piny mar Argob manie Bashan kod mieche madongo piero auchiel molwor gi ohinga motegno kendo nigi lodi mag rangeye mag mula);<verse eid="1KI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14"/>Ahinadab wuod Ido norito Mahanaim;<verse eid="1KI 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15"/>Ahimaz norito Naftali (kendo nokendo Basemath nyar Solomon);<verse eid="1KI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16"/>Baana wuod Hushai norito Asher kod Aloth.<verse eid="1KI 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17"/>Jehoshafat wuod Parua norito Isakar;<verse eid="1KI 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18"/>Shimei wuod Ela norito Benjamin;<verse eid="1KI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19"/>Geber wuod Uri norito Gilead (enie piny mane Sihon ruoth jo-Amor kod Og ruodh Bashan ne rito chon). En kende ema ne en jaduongʼ motelone gwengʼno.<verse eid="1KI 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Konyruok mapile mag Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20"/>Oganda jo-Juda gi jo-Israel ne ngʼeny machalo ka kuoyo manie e dho nam; negichiemo, mi negimetho kendo negimor. <verse eid="1KI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21"/>Kendo Solomon nobedo ruodh pinyno duto chakre Aora maduongʼ mar Yufrate nyaka e piny jo-Filistia mochweyo nyaka giko piny Misri. Pinjegi duto ne kelo osuru ni Solomon bende ne gin e bwo lochne ndalo duto.<verse eid="1KI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22"/>Chiemo mane Solomon nwangʼo odiechiengʼ kodiechiengʼ ne romo gunde piero auchiel mag mogo mayom kod gunde mia achiel gi piero ariyo ariyo mag mogo amoga; <verse eid="1KI 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23"/>rwedhi apar machwe mopongʼ, rwedhi piero ariyo machwe kod rombe gi diek mia achiel kaachiel gi mwanda; ogunde, ring ngawo kod awendo machwe.<verse eid="1KI 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24"/>Nimar nobedo gi loch kuom pinjeruodhi duto man yo podho chiengʼ mar Aora maduongʼ chakre Tifsa nyaka Gaza kendo ne en gi kwe gi joma olwore duto. <verse eid="1KI 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25"/>E ndalo mag ngima mar Solomon Juda gi Israel chakre Dan nyaka Bersheba nodak gi kwe ka ngʼato ka ngʼato tiyo e puothe mar mzabibu kod ngʼope.<verse eid="1KI 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26"/>Solomon ne nigi udi alufu piero angʼwen moger ni Farese kod Farese alufu apar gariyo.<verse eid="1KI 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27"/>Jodong gwengʼno, moro ka moro e dweye ne chiwo ni ruoth Solomon gi welo duto mane oluongo, maonge gimoro amora morem. <verse eid="1KI 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28"/>Bende ngʼato ka ngʼato nokelo Shairi gi lum e kuondegi mag keno ne farese maywa geche kod farese mamoko.<verse eid="1KI 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Rieko Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29"/>Nyasaye nomiyo Solomon rieko gi ngʼeyo matut moloyo kod winjo ma ok nyalo pimore mana ka kwoyo manie dho nam. <verse eid="1KI 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30"/>Rieko Solomon ne duongʼ moloyo jorieko duto manie yo wuok chiengʼ, bende noduongʼ moloyo rieko duto mag Misri. <verse eid="1KI 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31"/>Noriek moloyo ngʼato angʼata moriwo kata mana Ethan ja-Ezra kendo riek moloyo Heman gi Kalkol kod Darda yawuot Mahol. Kendo humbe nolandore e pinje molwore duto. <verse eid="1KI 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32"/>Nogoyo ngeche alufu adek kendo wende mane owero noromo alufu achiel gi abich. <verse eid="1KI 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33"/>Nowuoyo kuom kit yien kochako gi yiende Sida mag Lebanon nyaka owino magawore e kor udi. Bende nopuonjo ji kuom le kod winy gi le mamol kod rech. <verse eid="1KI 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34"/>Ji moa e pinje duto nobiro mondo owinji rieko Solomon koorgi gi ruodhi mag piny mane osewinjo humb riekone.<verse eid="1KI 4:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ikruok mar gero hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1"/>Kane Hiram ruodh Turo owinjo ni Solomon osewir mondo obed ruoth kar Daudi wuon-gi, nooro joote ire nikech nosebedo ka en osiepe kod Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2"/>Solomon nooro wachne Hiram kowacho niya,<verse eid="1KI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3"/>“Ingʼeyo ni nikech lwenje duto mane Daudi wuora kedogo koni gi koni mane miyo ok onyal gero hekalu moluongo Nying Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasache nyaka chop Jehova Nyasaye ket wasike duto e bwo tiende. <verse eid="1KI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4"/>To koro Jehova Nyasaye Nyasacha osemiya yweyo kuom pinje duto molwora bende onge Jawasigu kata masira moro amora. <verse eid="1KI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5"/>Omiyo achano gero hekalu ni Nying Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasacha kaka Jehova Nyasaye nochiko Daudi wuonwa kowacho ni, ‘Wuodi ma anaketi e kom loch kari biro gero hekalu ni Nyinga.’<verse eid="1KI 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6"/>“Kuom mano gol chik mondo ongʼadna Sida mag Lebanon. Jotichna biro tiyo kaachiel gi jotichni, bende abiro chulo jogi chudo moro amora miketo. Ingʼeyo ni waonge gi ngʼat ma olony e goyo yien piny kaka jo-Sidon.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7"/>Kane Hiram owinjo ote Solomon ne omor ahinya mine owacho niya, “Pak obed ni Jehova Nyasaye kawuono nikech osemiyo Daudi wuowi mariek mondo olochi kuom oganda maduongʼni.”<verse eid="1KI 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8"/>Omiyo Hiram nodwoko Solomon kawacho niya,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 5:8">“Aseyudo wach mane iorona kendo abiro timo duto midwaro kuom chiwo yiend Sida gi bao. <verse eid="1KI 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9"/>Joga biro ywayogi kagologi Lebanon nyaka e nam, kendo abiro kwangʼogi gi yie e nam nyaka kama iniwachi. Kanyo abiro pogogi kendo inyalo kawogi. To nyaka itim dwarona ka ichiwo chiemo moromo jooda ma joka ruoth duto.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10"/>Mano e kaka Hiram nochiwo ni Solomon gi yien duto mag Sida gi bao mane odwaro, <verse eid="1KI 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11"/>kendo Solomon nochiwo ni Hiram gunde alufu mia achiel gi piero ariyo gabich mag ngano mondo obed chiemb joode kod mo madirom lita mia angʼwen gi piero aboro. Solomon nomedo dhi nyime katimo maa ne Hiram higa ka higa. <verse eid="1KI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12"/>Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo Solomon rieko mana kaka nosesingorene. Ne nitie winjruok mar kwe e kind Hiram kod Solomon kendo gin ji ariyogo negitimo singruok e kindgi.<verse eid="1KI 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13"/>Ruoth Solomon nondiko jotich lwedo mar achuna e piny Israel duto maromo joma chwo alufu piero adek (30,000). <verse eid="1KI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14"/>Noorogi mondo gi dhi Lebanon dwe ka dwe ka gitiyo e migawo mar ji alufu apar (10,000) e dwe, omiyo negitieko dwe achiel Lebanon to dweche ariyo gitieko dala. Adoniram ema ne otelo e tich lwedo matek mar achunano. <verse eid="1KI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15"/>Solomon ne nigi jotingʼo alufu piero abiriyo (70,000) kod jopa kidi ewi got ji alufu piero aboro (80,000), <verse eid="1KI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16"/>kaachiel gi nyipeche alufu adek gi mia adek (3,300) mane ochungʼ ne tich. <verse eid="1KI 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17"/>Kane ruoth oketonegi chik negimuko kite madongo ma nengogi tek mag mise mag kite mopa mag hekalu. <verse eid="1KI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18"/>Kamano jogedo molony mag Solomon gi Hiram kod jo-Gibal nongʼado yien kendo oloso bepe kod kite mag gero hekalu.<verse eid="1KI 5:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Solomon gero hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1"/>E higa mar mia angʼwen gi piero aboro bangʼ ka jo-Israel osewuok Misri, e higa mar angʼwen mar loch Solomon kuom Israel e dwe mar Ziv, dwe mar ariyo nochako gero hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1KI 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2"/>Hekalu mane ruoth Solomon ogero ni Jehova Nyasaye borne noromo fut piero aboro gochiko kendo lachne ne romo fut piero adek to borne madhi malo ne romo fut piero angʼwen gangʼwen. <verse eid="1KI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3"/>Bor mar agola mane nitie e nyim hekalu noywayo lach hekalu, moromo fut piero adek kendo notingʼore malo maromo fut apar gabich. <verse eid="1KI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4"/>Noloso ni hekaluno dirise mogaji modiyore matindo. <verse eid="1KI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5"/>Bende nogero udi moko momakore gi kor kama ler mar lemo gi oko. Udigo nolworo kama ler mar lemo. <verse eid="1KI 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6"/>Dier ot mapiny lachne ne en fut apar, dier ot madiere ne en fut aboro, to dier ot mar adek lachne ne en fut apar. Kendo ne giweyo thuolo e kind kor ot ma oko mondo kik yien moriw pow kor ot.<verse eid="1KI 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7"/>Noger hekalu gi kite mopa mana kuma okuny but kendo kata ywak nyundo kata mar le kata mar gir tich moro amora ne ok owinji e kar gedo mar hekalu.<verse eid="1KI 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8"/>Dhoot midonjogo e ot mapiny ne nitie yo milambo mar hekalu to raidhi nochopo e ot madiere nyaka gorofa mar adek. <verse eid="1KI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9"/>Omiyo nogero hekalu motieko koume gi yiende kod bepe Sida. <verse eid="1KI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10"/>Kendo nogero udi molworo hekalu duto. Bor moro ka moro ne nyalo romo fut aboro bende ne gichomore gi hekalu gi bepe mag yiend sida.<verse eid="1KI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11"/>Wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ne Solomon kowacho niya, <verse eid="1KI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12"/>“Kaluwore gi hekaluni migero, kiluwo puonjna kendo itimo weche mamiyi kendo kirito chikena, to abiro chopo singo mane amiyo Daudi wuonu. <verse eid="1KI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13"/>Kendo abiro dak e kind jo-Israel bende ok anajwangʼ joga Israel.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14"/>Omiyo Solomon nogero hekalu motieke. <verse eid="1KI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15"/>Nochwado kor ot yo ka iye gi bepe sida chakre tiend ot nyaka yiend tado, bende noloso dier ot gi yiend bap Saipras. <verse eid="1KI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16"/>Nongʼado iye gi bap sida ka bor mopog gigo romo fut piero adek kochomo yo ka tok hekalu chakre tiend ot nyaka wi tado mondo olos kama ler mar lemo maiye miluongo ni Kama Ler Moloyo. <verse eid="1KI 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17"/>Ot maduongʼ mane nitie e nyim ot matin-no ne romo fut piero abich gochiko e borne. <verse eid="1KI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18"/>Ei hekaluno noketie bap sida mopa ka budho kod thiepene. Gik moko duto nolos gi yiend sida ma kata mana kidi ne ok nyal ne.<verse eid="1KI 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19"/>Noloso kama ler mar lemo ei hekalu mondo oketie Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1KI 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20"/>Bor mar kama ler mar lemo ne romo fut piero adek to lachne ne romo fut piero adek kendo borne madhi malo ne romo fut piero adek. Ne obawo ot maiye gi dhahabu lilo, bende noloso kendo mar misango gi bap sida. <verse eid="1KI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21"/>Solomon nobawo ii hekalu gi dhahabu lilo kendo nomedo thiwni mag dhahabu e nyim kama ler mar lemo. <verse eid="1KI 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22"/>Kamano nobawo yo ka ii ot duto gi dhahabu, bende nobawo kendo mar misango mar kama ler mar lemo gi dhahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23"/>Ei kama ler mar lemo noloso malaika mar kerubi ariyo gi bap Zeituni ka moro ka moro borne madhi malo romo fut apar gabich. <verse eid="1KI 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24"/>Bwomb kerubi achiel mokwongo ne romo fut aboro kendo bwombe machielo ne romo fut aboro kamano bende bwombene duto ne romo fut apar gauchiel. <verse eid="1KI 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25"/>Kerubi mar ariyo bende bwombene ne romo fut apar gauchiel, nimar kerubi ariyogi ne chalre e romgi kendo losogi. <verse eid="1KI 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26"/>Bor kerubi ka kerubi madhi malo ne romo fut apar gauchiel. <verse eid="1KI 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27"/>Noketo kerubigo ei ot matin mar hekalu maiye ka bwombegi oyarore. Bwomb kerubi achiel nomulo kor ot konchiel, ka bwombe machielo nemulo kor ot komachielo, kendo bwombegi nemulore e chuny ot. <verse eid="1KI 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28"/>Nobawo kerubigo gi dhahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29"/>E kor ot molworo hekalu, e udi ma iye gi udi ma oko, nopayoe kido mar kerubi, gi mag yiend othidhe kod thiepe maupe. <verse eid="1KI 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30"/>Bende nobawo dier udi maiye gi ma oko gi dhahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31"/>To dhoot midonjogo ei kama ler mar lemo noloso gi yiend zeituni ma lachne dirom fut auchiel. <verse eid="1KI 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32"/>E dhoudi ariyogo mag yiend zeituni nopayoe kerubi, gi yiend othidhe kod thiepe maupe, kendo nobawo kerubi kod yiend othidhego gi dhahabu moleny. <verse eid="1KI 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33"/>Kamano bende noloso thike angʼwen mag yiend zeituni molosogo dhoot mar ot maduongʼ. <verse eid="1KI 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34"/>Bende noloso dhoudi ariyo gi yiend saipras kamoro ka moro nigi pata ariyo. <verse eid="1KI 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35"/>Nopayo kerubi gi yiend othith kod maupe moyarore kuomgi mobawogi gi dhahabu mothedhi maromre duto.<verse eid="1KI 6:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36"/>Kendo nogero laru maiye gi kite mopa molwore nyadidek kaachiel gi laini achiel mar bap yiend sida.<verse eid="1KI 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37"/>Mise mar hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye noketi e higa mar angʼwen e dwe mar Zif. <verse eid="1KI 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38"/>E higa mar apar gachiel e dwe mar Bul, dwe mar aboro hekalu notieki chutho kaka nochan ni onego gere. Notieko higni abiriyo kigere.<verse eid="1KI 6:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Solomon ogero ode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1"/>To Solomon nokawo higni apar gadek mondo otiek gero ode. <verse eid="1KI 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2"/>Nogero ode gi Bungu mar Lebanon ma borne romo fut mia achiel gi piero abich gachiel to lachne romo fut piero abiriyo gabich gi nus kendo borne madhi malo romo fut piero angʼwen gangʼwen. Nogure ewi laini angʼwen mag sirni mag sida moriwie bape mag sida. <verse eid="1KI 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3"/>Noumo wiye gi bap sida mokadho e sirni piero angʼwen gabich, e laini ka laini apar gabich. <verse eid="1KI 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4"/>Dirise noketi adek adek modhi malo momanyore moro gi moro. <verse eid="1KI 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5"/>Sirni mag dhoudi ma bethene ariyo momanyore romre; noketi adek adek nyime ka gimanyore.<verse eid="1KI 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6"/>Bende nogero od sirni ma borne romo fut piero aboro gariyo to lachne romo fut piero angʼwen gochiko. Ne en gi agola man-gi sirni e nyime.<verse eid="1KI 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7"/>Nogero od kom duongʼ, Od ngʼado Bura kama ne ongʼadoe bura kendo noume gi sida koa piny nyaka e tado. <verse eid="1KI 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8"/>Bende od ruoth mane obiro dakie nogero e laru machielo e tok od bura to nogere mana machal gi od bura, Solomon bende noloso od dak machal kamano ni nyar Farao mane okendo.<verse eid="1KI 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9"/>Udigo duto chakre oko nyaka laru maduongʼ kendo chakre mise nyaka yiendambewa noger gi kite ma nengogi tek mopa iye gi oko kendo nongʼadgi mowinjore kaka idwaro. <verse eid="1KI 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10"/>Mise ne oger gi kite madongo kendo ma nengogi tek maromo fut apar gabich kod fut apar gachiel gi nus. <verse eid="1KI 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11"/>To e wiye malo nokete kite ma nengogi tek mopa kaka owinjore kendo noriwie bape sida. <verse eid="1KI 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12"/>Laru maduongʼ noluor gi ohinga mar kite mopa ma lachne en kite adek gi laini achiel mar bap sida mobar machal mana gi laru maiye mar hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye gi agolane.<verse eid="1KI 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gige hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13"/>Ruoth Solomon nooro jaote Turo ma oomo Huram, <verse eid="1KI 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14"/>ma min-gi ne en dhako ma chwore otho, nyar dhood Naftali kendo wuon-gi ne ja-Turo kendo ngʼat molony e loso mula. Huram ne en ngʼat mariek, ngʼat man-gi ngʼeyo kendo molony ahinya e kit tije duto mag mula. Nobiro ir ruoth Solomon motimo tije duto mane omiye.<verse eid="1KI 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15"/>Noloso sirni madongo ariyo mag mula moro ka moro borne madhi malo romo fut piero ariyo gauchiel to alworane romo fut apar gauchiel. <verse eid="1KI 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16"/>Bende noloso gik moko ariyo machalo agulni mag mula mondo oketi ewi sirni. Bor mar moro ka moro ne romo fut apar gauchiel. <verse eid="1KI 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17"/>Bende noloso thiwni mogaji mane omako gik machalo agulnigo ewi sirnigo, thiwnigo noketi abiriyo abiriyo ewi gik machalo agulnigo. <verse eid="1KI 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18"/>Noloso gik mongʼinore e laini ariyo molworo thiwnigo mongʼawogi kuom gik machalo agulni manie ewi siro. Notimo mano ewi moro ka moro. <verse eid="1KI 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19"/>To gik machalo agulni mane ni ewi sirni mag agola nolosi e kido mag ondanyo ka borgi romo fut auchiel gi nus. <verse eid="1KI 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20"/>Ewi gik machalo agulni manie wi sirni ariyogo, ewi kama olosi ka tawo but thiwni, noketie gik mongʼinore mia ariyo e laini molwore. <verse eid="1KI 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21"/>Nochungo sirnigo e agola mar hekalu. Siro ma yo milambo nomiyo nying ni Jakin (tiende ni osegurore), to siro ma yo nyandwat nomiyo nying ni Boaz (tiende ni teko nitie kuome). <verse eid="1KI 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22"/>Gik machalo agulni mane ni e wiye nolosi kaka ondanyo. Kamano tich sirnigo norumo.<verse eid="1KI 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23"/>Eka noloso Nam mar mula moleny, molworore kaka karaya, ma lachne romo fut apar gabich to tutne romo fut aboro. Alworane duto ne romo fut piero angʼwen gangʼwen. <verse eid="1KI 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24"/>E bwo dhoge nolwore gi pugni ma kindgi romo fut achiel gi nus, pugni nochan e laini ariyo ka gimakore gi Namno.<verse eid="1KI 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25"/>Karaya mar Namno norenji e ngʼe rwedhi apar gariyo, ka adek ngʼiyo yo nyandwat, to adek ngʼiyo yo podho chiengʼ, to adek ngʼiyo yo milambo bende adek ngʼiyo yo wuok chiengʼ. Karaya mar Namno noyiere kuomgi kendo tiendegi machien nochomo ka iye. <verse eid="1KI 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26"/>Lachne ne romo bat achiel morie to dhoge ne chalo gi dho kikombe, mana ka ondanyo mathiewo. Notingʼo pi manyalo romo lita alufu adek.<verse eid="1KI 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27"/>Bende noloso rachungi apar mag mula minyalo dhir; ka moro ka moro romo fut auchiel gi nus e bor madhi malo to lachne to romo fut abich. <verse eid="1KI 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28"/>Ma e kaka rachungigo nolosi: Nosirgi gi bao koa piny nyaka malo. <verse eid="1KI 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29"/>E bethe bepe mosirogigo ne nitie kido mar sibuoche, kido mar rwedhi kod kido mar kerubi kendo ewi sirnigo bende. E wigi malo kendo e bwo sibuoche gi rwedhigo ne nitie gik machalo maua mothedhi. <verse eid="1KI 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30"/>Rachungi ka rachungi ne nigi tiende angʼwen mag mula, man kod chumbe mag mula molworore kendo moro ka moro ewi rachungi angʼwen-go nokete karaya molosi e kido mar maua koni gi kocha. <verse eid="1KI 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31"/>Yo ka iye mag rachungigo ne nitie hoho molworore ma tutne nyalo romo fut achiel gi nus. Hohoni nolwore, kendo bwoye ne oloyo fut achiel gi nus matin. To alwora mar dhoge nolosie kido. Bepe momako sirnigo ne ok olworore to ne gin Skweya. <verse eid="1KI 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32"/>Tiende angʼwen-go ne nitie e bwo bepego kendo kama tielogo ne lworore notudi e rachungi. <verse eid="1KI 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33"/>Tiendego nolos kaka tiende gach faras; chumbe ma tiende lworore, tiende molworore, weche momake kod dag waya nolos gi mula moleny.<verse eid="1KI 7:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34"/>Rachungi ka rachungi ne nigi ramaki angʼwen e kona ka kona molos koa e rachungi. <verse eid="1KI 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35"/>Ewi rachungino ne nitie gima olworore, ma tutne ne ok oromo kata mana nus fut. Rachungi gi bepe nomako siro koago malo. <verse eid="1KI 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36"/>Noketo kido mar kerubi gi sibuor kod yiend othidhe e bethe rachungi kod bepe kamoro amora mane ni thuolo, gi kido mar maua e alworane duto. <verse eid="1KI 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37"/>Ma e kaka noloso rachungi apargo. Giduto nolenygi machalre e gimoro achiel bende ne gichalre e romgi kod losogi.<verse eid="1KI 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38"/>Eka noloso kareche mag mula apar ka moro ka moro tingʼo pi maromo lita mia aboro gi piero aboro, kendo ma lachne nyalo romo fut auchiel gi nus, ka karaya ka karaya noketo ewi rachungi apargo moro ka moro. <verse eid="1KI 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39"/>Noketo rachungi abich yo milambo mar hekalu kendo abich noketo yo nyandwat. Noketo Nam yo milambo, e kona ma yo milambo mar wuok chiengʼ mar hekalu. <verse eid="1KI 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40"/>Bende noloso agulni gi opewni kod tewni mag kiro remo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:40">Kamano Huram notieko tich duto mane otimo ne ruoth Solomon e hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye:<verse eid="1KI 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41"/>Sirni ariyo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:41">agulni ariyo machalo tawo moketi ewi sirni;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:41">thiwni ariyo mane okedgo gik machalo agulni ariyo machalo tawo moketi ewi sirni;<verse eid="1KI 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42"/>gik mongʼinore mia angʼwen mag thiwni laini ariyo, moluwore (laini ariyo mag thiwni oketi e laini ariyo mag gik mongʼinore mane okedgo gik machalo agulni molos kaka tawo ewi sirni);<verse eid="1KI 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43"/>rachungi apargo kod karechegi apar;<verse eid="1KI 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44"/>Karaya mar Nam gi rwedhi apar gariyo manie e bwoye;<verse eid="1KI 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45"/>Agulni gi opewni kod tewni mag kiro remo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 7:45"/>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:45">Gigi duto mane Huram oloso ni ruoth Solomon ni hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye nolos gi mula moleny. <verse eid="1KI 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46"/>Ruoth nomiyo giwangʼo lowo mane gisechweyo e paw Jordan man e kind Sukoth gi Zarethan. <verse eid="1KI 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47"/>Solomon noweyo gigi duto ma ok opimo nikech negingʼeny ahinya, pek mar mulano ne ok ongʼere.<verse eid="1KI 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48"/>Kendo Solomon noloso gik mitiyogo manie ei hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 7:48"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:48">Kendo mar misango mar dhahabu;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:48">mesa mar dhahabu nikete makati e nyim Ruoth;<verse eid="1KI 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49"/>rachungi teyni molos gi dhahabu mopwodhi (abich korachwich kendo abich koracham e nyim kama ler mar lemo);</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:49">maupe molosi mag dhahabu gi teyni gi ramaki;<verse eid="1KI 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50"/>gi karache mag dhahabu mopwodhi, gi makas mingʼadogo otambi, tewni mag kiro remo, dise, gi tawo mar ubani;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:50">gi dhoudi molos gi dhahabu mag udi mar ot maiye gi Kama Ler Moloyo, kaachiel gi dhoudi mar laru mar hekalu.<verse eid="1KI 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51"/>Ka tije duto mane ruoth Solomon osetimo e hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye noserumo, nokelo gik mane Daudi wuon-gi osewalo kaka fedha gi dhahabu kod gik mitimogo lemo kendo noketogi e od keno mar hekalu Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1KI 7:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Sandug Muma okel e hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1"/>Bangʼe Ruoth Solomon noluongo jodong jo-Israel mondo odhi ire Jerusalem gi jodong dhoudi duto gi jotend anywola mag Israel mondo gikel Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye koa Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi miluongo ni Sayun. <verse eid="1KI 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2"/>Jo-Israel duto nochokore kanyakla ir Ruoth Solomon e kinde mag nyasi e dwe mar Ethanim, ma en dwe mar abiriyo.<verse eid="1KI 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3"/>Kane jodong Israel duto osechopo, jodolo nokawo Sandug Muma, <verse eid="1KI 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4"/>kendo negikelo Sandug Muma mar Jehova Nyasaye gi Hemb Romo kod gik moko duto maler mane ni e iye. Jodolo kod jo-Lawi notingʼogi, <verse eid="1KI 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5"/>kendo Ruoth Solomon kod oganda jo-Israel duto mane ochokore molwore nochopo e nyim Sandug Muma; kendo negichiwo rombe kod dhok mangʼeny mane kwan-gi ok nyal ndiki kata kwan kaka misango.<verse eid="1KI 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6"/>Eka jodolo nokelo Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Jehova Nyasaye kama ne olosne ei kama ler mar lemo mar hekalu ma en Kama Ler Moloyo mi gikete e bwomb kerubi. <verse eid="1KI 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7"/>Kerubigo noyaro bwombegi ewi kama noketie Sandug Muma kendo ne giumo Sandug Muma gi ludhe mitingʼego. <verse eid="1KI 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8"/>Ludhegi ne boyo ahinya ma gikogi ne inyalo ne koa e nyim Kama Ler e nyim kama ler mar lemo, to ne ok ginen gi oko mar Kama Ler kendo pod gin kanyo nyaka chil kawuono. <verse eid="1KI 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9"/>Ne onge gimoro ei Sandug Muma makmana kite ariyo mopa mane Musa oketo e iye kane en Horeb kama Jehova Nyasaye ne otimoe singruok kod jo-Israel kane gisewuok Misri.<verse eid="1KI 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10"/>Kane jodolo osewuok ei Kama Ler, bor polo noimo hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye, <verse eid="1KI 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11"/>kendo jodolo ne ok nyal tiyo tijegi nikech bor polo nimar duongʼ mar Jehova Nyasaye nopongʼo hekalu.<verse eid="1KI 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12"/>Eka Solomon nowacho niya, “Jehova Nyasaye osewacho ni enodag ei bor polo motimo mudho; <verse eid="1KI 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13"/>adier asegeroni hekalu marahuma kama inidagie nyaka chiengʼ.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14"/>Kane oganda jo-Israel duto ochungʼ kanyo, ruoth nolokore mogwedhogi. <verse eid="1KI 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15"/>Eka nowacho niya,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 8:15">“Pak obed ne Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, mosetimo gi lwete gima ne osingo gi dhoge owuon ni Daudi wuonwa. <verse eid="1KI 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16"/>Nimar nowacho ni, ‘Chakre ndalo mane agolo joga koa Misri, pok ayiero dala maduongʼ e dhoot moro amora mar Israel mondo oger hekalu kanyo ni Nyinga, to aseyiero Daudi mondo otel ni joga Israel.’<verse eid="1KI 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17"/>“Daudi wuora noketo e chunye mondo oger hekalu moluongo nying Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel. <verse eid="1KI 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18"/>To Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ni Daudi wuora ni, ‘Nitimo maber mondo ibed gi wach gero hekalu ni nyinga e chunyi. <verse eid="1KI 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19"/>Kata kamano, in ok niger hekalu, to wuodi, ma en ringri gi rembi iwuon, en ema noger hekalu ni Nyinga.’<verse eid="1KI 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20"/>“Jehova Nyasaye oserito singruok mane otimo: Asekawo loch wuora Daudi kendo asebet e kom loch mar Israel, mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosingo, kendo asegero hekalu ni Nying Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel. <verse eid="1KI 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21"/>Aseloso kar Sandug Muma, moketie singruok mane Jehova Nyasaye otimo kod kwerewa kane ogologi Misri.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lemo mar Solomon mar gwedho hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22"/>Eka Solomon nochungʼ e nyim kendo mar misango mar Jehova Nyasaye e nyim oganda duto mar jo-Israel, kendo norieyo bedene kochomo polo <verse eid="1KI 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23"/>kowacho kama:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 8:23">“Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, onge Nyasaye moro amora machal kodi e polo malo kata e piny mwalo, in e Nyasaye marito singruok mar herane ni jotichne maluwo yoreni gi chunygi duto. <verse eid="1KI 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24"/>Iserito singruokni mane itimo gi jatichni Daudi wuora ne isingori gi dhogi kendo isechopo singruokno gi lweti mana kaka en kawuononi.<verse eid="1KI 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25"/>“Koro Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel rit singruok mane itimo gi jatichni Daudi wuora kiwachone niya, ‘Ok inibed maonge gi ngʼato mobedo e kom loch e nyima e piny Israel, to mana ka yawuoti otimo tim makare e nyima mana kaka isetimo.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26"/>To koro, yaye Nyasach Israel, yie wach mane isingo ni jatichni Daudi wuora otimre mana kaka ne isingo.<verse eid="1KI 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27"/>“To bende Nyasaye nyalo dak e piny? Kata polo malo kata polo mabor moloyo ok nyal romi. To koro hekalu mageroni, to diromi nade! <verse eid="1KI 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28"/>Kata kamano chik iti ni lamo jatichni gi kwayone mar ngʼwono, yaye Jehova Nyasaye Nyasacha. Winji ywak gi lemo ma jatichni lamo e nyimi kawuono. <verse eid="1KI 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29"/>Mad wangʼi rang hekaluni otieno kod odiechiengʼ, kama niwacho niya, ‘Nyinga nobed kanyo,’ mondo iwinji lemo ma jatichni lamo kochomo odni. <verse eid="1KI 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30"/>Winji lamo mar jatichni kaachiel gi jogi Israel ka gilamo ka gichomo odni. Winji gi e polo kar dakni, kendo kiwinjo, to iwenwa richowa.<verse eid="1KI 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31"/>“Ka ngʼato oketho ni wadgi kendo dwarore ni mondo okwongʼre kendo obiro mokwongʼore e nyim kendo mar misango manie hekaluni, <verse eid="1KI 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32"/>to iwinji gi e polo kendo itim kaka owinjore. Ngʼad bura e kind jotichni, kikumo joketho kendo iket richogi e wigi bende joma onge ketho iket kare kaluwore gi timgi makare.<verse eid="1KI 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33"/>“Ka jogi Israel olo e lweny gi jowasikgi nikech gisekethoni, to bangʼe gilokore mi gipako nyingi, ka gilamo kendo gikwayo e hekaluni, <verse eid="1KI 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34"/>to iwinjgi gi e polo kendo iwe richo jogi Israel kendo iduog-gi e piny mane imiyo kweregi.<verse eid="1KI 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35"/>“Ka polo olor kendo koth onge nikech jogi osekethoni to ka gilemo kaeni ka gipako nyingi kendo ka gilokore giweyo richogi nikech isekelonegi chandruok, <verse eid="1KI 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36"/>to yie mondo iwinjgi gie polo kendo iwene jotichni ma jo-Israel richogi. Puonjgi yo makare mar dak kendo iornegi koth e piny mane imiyo jogi kaka girkeni margi.<verse eid="1KI 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37"/>“Ka kech kata dera omako piny, kata ka abach omako cham ewi dongo kata ka bonyo kata kungu kata ka jowasigu olworo miechgi madongo kata ka midekre kata tuo omakogi, <verse eid="1KI 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38"/>to ka ngʼato kuom jogi ma jo-Israel olemo kata okwayi, ka gingʼeyo gima chando chunygi kendo ka girieyo bedegi kochomo hekaluni, <verse eid="1KI 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39"/>to yie iwinji gie polo, kama idakie. Wenegi richogi kendo tim ne ngʼato ka ngʼato gima owinjore gi gik motimo nikech ingʼeyo chunygi (nikech in kendi ema ingʼeyo chuny dhano), <verse eid="1KI 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40"/>mondo omi gilwori ndalogi duto ma gin-go e piny mane imiyo kwerewa.<verse eid="1KI 8:40"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41"/>“To kuom jadak ma ok achiel kuom jogi Israel moa e piny mabor nikech nyingi, <verse eid="1KI 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42"/>nimar ji biro winjo humb nyingi maduongʼ gi mar lweti maratego kod badi marabora moriere, ka gibiro ma gilemo ka gichomo hekaluni <verse eid="1KI 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43"/>to yie mondo iwinji gie polo kama idakie kendo tim gimoro amora ma jadakno okwayi, mondo ogendini duto mag piny ongʼe nyingi kendo oluori mana kaka jogi Israel, kendo mondo gingʼe ni ot ma asegeroni luongo nyingi.<verse eid="1KI 8:43"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44"/>“Ka jogi odhi kedo gi jowasikgi, kamoro amora ma ibiro orogie, ka gilamo Jehova Nyasaye ka gichomo dalani miseyiero kendo hekalu masegero maluongo nyingi; <verse eid="1KI 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45"/>to yie iwinji gie polo lamogi kod kwayogi kendo konygi.<verse eid="1KI 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46"/>“To ka giketho e nyimi, nimar onge ngʼato kata achiel ma ok jaketho mi ikecho kodgi, kendo ichiwogi e lwet wasikgi mondo otergi e twech e piny wasikgigo, kuma bor kata machiegni; <verse eid="1KI 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47"/>to eka bangʼe giloko pachgi e piny motwegieno mi chunygi olokore giweyo richo, kendo gikwayi ka gin e piny wasikgi niya, ‘Wasetimo richo kendo waseketho bende wasetimo tim mamono.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48"/>Kendo ka gidwogo iri gi chunygi duto kod ngimagi duto, e piny wasikgi mane otweyogieno, kendo gilami ka gichomo pinygi mane imiyo kweregi, kod dala mane iyiero, gi hekalu ma asegero ni nyingi; <verse eid="1KI 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49"/>to yie mondo iwinj lemogi gi kwayogi gie polo kama idakie kendo ikonygi. <verse eid="1KI 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50"/>Yie iwe ni jogi mosetimo richo e nyimi, wenegi kethogi duto magisetimo e nyimi kendo mi joma ne omakogi okechgi. <verse eid="1KI 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51"/>Nimar gin jogi kendo mwanduni mane igolo e piny Misri, kigologi kama mae kakni ka kama ithedhe nyinyo.<verse eid="1KI 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52"/>“Yie wangʼi one kwayo jatichni kod kwayo mag jogi Israel, bende yie iwinjgi kinde moro amora ma giywaknie. <verse eid="1KI 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53"/>Nimar niyierogi e kind ogendini duto mag piny mondo gibed girkeni, mana kaka ninyiso jatichni Musa kane igolo kwerewa e piny Misri; yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54"/>Kane Solomon osetieko lamogi duto kod kwayogi ni Jehova Nyasaye, nochungʼ oa e nyim kendo mar misango mar Jehova Nyasaye, kama nogoyoe chonge kotingʼo bade kochomo polo. <verse eid="1KI 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55"/>Nochungʼ mogwedho chokruok duto mar Israel gi dwol maduongʼ kowacho niya,<verse eid="1KI 8:55"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56"/>“Pak obed ni Jehova Nyasaye mosemiyo joge Israel kwe mana kaka nosingo. Onge kata mana wach achiel ma ok osechopo kuom gik moko duto mabeyo mane ochiwo kuom jatichne Musa. <verse eid="1KI 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57"/>Mad Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa obed kodwa mana kaka nobedo gi kwerewa, mad kik owewa kata jwangʼowa. <verse eid="1KI 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58"/>Mad olok chunywa ire, mondo wawuoth e yorene duto kendo wamak chikene gi puonjne kod buchene mane omiyo kwerewa. <verse eid="1KI 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59"/>Kendo mad wechenagi maselamo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, obed machiegni gi Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa odiechiengʼ gotieno, mondo okony jatichne kendo okony joge Israel kaluwore gi dwaro mar odiechiengʼ kodiechiengʼ; <verse eid="1KI 8:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60"/>mondo ji duto manie piny ongʼe ni Jehova Nyasaye e Nyasaye kendo ni onge moro. <verse eid="1KI 8:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61"/>To chunyu nyaka chiwre chuth ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa kudak moluwore gi yorene kendo kurito chikene kaka e kindeni.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon ogwedho hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62"/>Eka ruoth kod jo-Israel duto mane ni kode nochiwo misengini e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1KI 8:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63"/>Solomon nochiwo misango mag lalruok ni Jehova Nyasaye: kwan-gi ne romo dhok alufu piero ariyo gi ariyo kod rombe gi diek maromo alufu mia achiel gi piero ariyo. Kamano ruoth kod jo-Israel duto nowalo hekalu ni Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1KI 8:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64"/>Chiengʼono ruoth nopwodho dier laru mane nitie e nyim hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye kendo kanyo nochiwoe misengini miwangʼo pep gi cham michiwo kod bor misango mar lalruok, nikech kendo mar misango mar mula mantie e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ne tin ahinya mane ok nyal tingʼo misangogo duto, kaka misango miwangʼo pep gi mag cham kod mag sawo.<verse eid="1KI 8:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65"/>Kamano Solomon notimo sawo e kindeno kaachiel gi jo-Israel duto mane ni kode chokruok maduongʼ miwuoro kotingʼo joma oa Lebo Hamath nyaka Wadi man Misri. Negitimo nyasino e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa kuom ndalo abiriyo kendo gichak gimedo ndalo abiriyo mamoko duto ne gin ndalo apar gangʼwen. <verse eid="1KI 8:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66"/>Kinyne nomiyo ji thuolo mar ke. Negigwedho ruoth mi gidhi e miechgi, ka gimor kendo giil e chunygi nikech gik moko duto mabeyo mane Jehova Nyasaye osetimo ni jatichne Daudi kod joge Israel.<verse eid="1KI 8:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Jehova Nyasaye ofwenyore ne Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1"/>Kane Solomon osetieko gero hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye kod dala maduongʼ ma ruoth dakie kendo nosetimo duto mane chunye dwaro, <verse eid="1KI 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2"/>Jehova Nyasaye nochako ofwenyorene kendo mar ariyo mana kaka nosefwenyorene Gibeon. <verse eid="1KI 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowachone niya,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 9:3">“Asewinjo lamo kod kwayo mitimo e nyima; asewalo hekalu misegero, mondo Nyinga obedie nyaka chiengʼ. Wangʼa kod chunya nobed kanyo kinde duto.<verse eid="1KI 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4"/>“To in, kiwuotho e nyima gi chuny makare kod bidhruok, kaka Daudi wuonu notimo, kendo timo mago duto machiki kendo kimako puonjna kod buchena, <verse eid="1KI 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5"/>to abiro guro kom lochni kuom Israel nyaka chiengʼ mana kaka nasingo ni Daudi wuonu kane awachone ni, ‘Kinde duto ok inichand ngʼama nyalo bedo e kom loch mar Israel.’<verse eid="1KI 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6"/>“To ka in iwuon kata yawuoti olokore moweya kendo ok oluwo chikena kod buchena ma asemiyi mi odhi olamo nyiseche moko kendo otiyonigi, <verse eid="1KI 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7"/>to anangʼad Israel oko e piny ma asemiyogi kendo anakwed hekaluni ma asewalo ni Nyinga. Israel koro nobed mana wach ngero kendo gir achaya e kind ogendini duto. <verse eid="1KI 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8"/>Kata obedo ni hekaluni koro nigi duongʼ, ji duto mabiro kadho bute nowuor kendo nohum ka gipenjo ni, ‘Angʼo momiyo Jehova Nyasaye osetimo gima chalo kama ni pinyni kod hekaluni?’ <verse eid="1KI 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9"/>Ji biro dwoko kawacho ni, ‘Nikech gisejwangʼo Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachgi mane ogolo kweregi oa Misri, kendo giseluwo bangʼ nyiseche mamoko, ka gilamogi kendo gitiyo nigi, kuom mano Jehova Nyasaye nokelo chandruok duto kuomgi.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tije mamoko mag Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10"/>E giko higni piero ariyo e kinde mane Solomon ogeroe udi ariyogi ma gin hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye kod dala maduongʼ mar ruoth, <verse eid="1KI 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11"/>Ruoth Solomon nochiwo ni Hiram ruoth Turo mier piero ariyo manie piny Galili, nikech Hiram nomiye yiend sida gi saipras kod dhahabu mane odwaro. <verse eid="1KI 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12"/>To kane Hiram owuok Turo modhi mondo one mier mane Solomon osemiye ne ok omor kodgi. <verse eid="1KI 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13"/>Omiyo nowachone niya, “Owadwa, magi to mier machal nadi misemiya?” Kendo nochako kanyo ni Piny Kabul, nying ma pod iluongego nyaka chil kawuono. <verse eid="1KI 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14"/>Koro Hiram noseoro ni ruoth dhahabu maromo kilo alufu angʼwen.<verse eid="1KI 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15"/>Magi e chenro mar tich achuna mane Ruoth Solomon ondiko mondo ogergo hekalu ni Jehova Nyasaye, gi dala ruoth, gi kuonde ohula, kod ohinga mar Jerusalem, gi mier madongo mag Hazor gi Megido kod Gezer. <verse eid="1KI 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16"/>(Noyudo ka Farao ruodh Misri nosekedo mokawo Gezer. Nowangʼe monego jo-Kanaan mane odakie momiye kaka mich mar arus ni nyare mane chi Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17"/>Kendo Solomon nochako ogero Gezer). Nogero Beth Horon ma yo ka mwalo, <verse eid="1KI 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18"/>gi Baalath kod Tadmor manie thim e pinye, <verse eid="1KI 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19"/>kaachiel gi mier madongo mag kuonde kenone kod mier matindo mag gechene gi faresege kod gimoro amora mane chunye nyalo dwaro mondo oger e Jerusalem, kata e Lebanon, kendo e pinje duto mane enie gi loch.<verse eid="1KI 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20"/>Ji duto mane odongʼ e pinyno koa kuom jo-Amor gi jo-Hiti kod jo-Perizi gi jo-Hivi kod jo-Jebus (ogendinigi ne ok jo-Israel), <verse eid="1KI 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21"/>tiende ni, nyikwagi mane odongʼ e piny, ma jo-Israel ne ok otieko; Solomon nolokogi wasumbini michuno mondo oti githuon, kaka obet nyaka chil kawuono. <verse eid="1KI 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22"/>To Solomon ne ok oketo ja-Israel moro amora obedo kaka misumbane, to noketogi kaka jolwenje, gi nyipechene kod jodonge mag pinygi gi jotend lweny, jotelo mag geche lweny kod joriemb gechene. <verse eid="1KI 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23"/>Bende gin ema negidoko jodongo mane otelo ni tije duto mag Solomon, duto jodongo mia abich gi piero abich kaka nyipeche mag joma ne tiyo.<verse eid="1KI 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24"/>Bangʼ kane nyar Farao osewuok e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi modhi e dala mane Solomon ogerone, eka Solomon nogero ohinga molworo ode.<verse eid="1KI 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25"/>Solomon ne timo misango miwangʼo pep gi misango mar lalruok nyadidek e higa ewi kendo mar misango mane ogero ni Jehova Nyasaye bende nowangʼo ubani e nyim Jehova Nyasaye mi nochopo dwaro mar hekalu.<verse eid="1KI 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26"/>Ruoth Solomon bende nohondho yiedhi kama iluongo ni Ezion Geber machiegni gi Elath e piny Edom e dho Nam Makwar. <verse eid="1KI 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27"/>Omiyo Hiram nooro joge ma jokwangʼ mane ongʼeyo nam mondo oti e yiedhi mag Solomon kaachiel gi joge Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28"/>Negikwangʼ nyaka Ofir kendo negikelo dhahabu maromo kilo alufu apar gangʼwen mine gikelo ne ruoth Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Ruoth madhako mar Sheba olimo Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1"/>Kane ruoth madhako mar Sheba owinjo humb Solomon kod winjruok manie kinde gi nying Jehova Nyasaye, nobiro mondo oteme gi penjo matek. <verse eid="1KI 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2"/>Kane ochopo Jerusalem gi oganda maduongʼ, ngamia motingʼo gik mangʼwe ngʼar, dhahabu mogundho kod kite mabeyo ma nengogi tek nobiro ir Solomon kendo owuoyo kode kuom gik moko duto mane nitie e pache. <verse eid="1KI 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3"/>Solomon nodwoko penjone duto; nimar onge gima ne tek mane ruoth ok nyal lerone. <verse eid="1KI 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4"/>Kane ruoth madhako mar Sheba oneno rieko duto mag Solomon kod ode mar dak, manosegero, <verse eid="1KI 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5"/>gi chiemo mane ni e mesane, gi bet mar jodonge, gi rwakruok mar jotije mapogo chiemo, gi rwakruok mar jotije machiwo divai kod misango miwangʼo pep mane otimo e hekalu Jehova Nyasaye, dhoge nomoko.<verse eid="1KI 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6"/>Nowachone ruoth niya, “Kare humb timbeni kod riekoni mane awinjo e pinya awuon en adier. <verse eid="1KI 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7"/>To ne ok ayie gigo mane giwacho nyaka nabiro maneno gi wangʼa awuon. Adier kata mana nus wechego ne ok onyisa; kuom rieko gi mwandu iloyo weche ma asewinjo. <verse eid="1KI 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8"/>Mano kaka jogi mor manade! En mor manade ne jotendi mosiko kachungʼ e nyimi kendo winjo riekoni! <verse eid="1KI 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9"/>Pak odogne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi mosebedo mamor kodi moketi e kom loch mar Israel. Nikech hera mosiko mar Jehova Nyasaye ni jo-Israel oseketi ruoth mondo irit bura kendo ingʼade gadiera kod tim makare.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10"/>Eka nomiyo ruoth dhahabu ma pekne romo kilo alufu angʼwen mia abich, gi gik mangʼeny mangʼwe ngʼar kaachiel gi kite ma nengogi tek. Ne ok ochak okel kendo gik mangʼeny mangʼwe ngʼar marom gi mago mane ruoth madhako mar Sheba nomiyo Ruoth Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11"/>Yiedhi mag Hiram nokelo dhahabu moa Ofir kendo negikelo koa kuro yiedhi madongo mag yiend almugo mangʼeny gi kite ma nengogi tek. <verse eid="1KI 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12"/>Ruoth notiyo gi yiend almugo mondo olosgo sirni mag hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye kod od ruoth kendo mondo olosgo thumbe nyatiti gi orutu ni jower. Nyaka chakre ndalono ok osekelie kata nenoe yiend almugo mangʼeny marom gi mago.<verse eid="1KI 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13"/>Ruoth Solomon nomiyo ruoth madhako mar Sheba gik moko duto mane chunye dwaro kendo mane okwayo, ewi gigo duto mane osemiye mag keno mar ruoth. Eka nowuok mi odok e pinye kaachiel gi jotije.<verse eid="1KI 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Huma mar mwandu Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14"/>Pek dhahabu mane Solomon yudo higa ka higa ne nyalo romo kilo alufu piero ariyo gabich, <verse eid="1KI 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15"/>ka ok okwan osuru misolo kuom jo-ohala kod joyiedhi madongo mag ruodhi duto mag Arabia kod jotend piny.<verse eid="1KI 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16"/>Ruoth Solomon nochwogo kuodi madongo mia ariyo mag dhahabu kendo kuot ka kuot nochwog gi dhahabu ma pekne romo kilo adek gi nus. <verse eid="1KI 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17"/>Bende nochwogo okumbni matindo mia adek mobaw gi dhahabu, okumba ka okumba nobaw gi dhahabu ma pekne romo kilo ariyo. Magi duto ruoth noketo e ode manogero e Bungu mag Lebanon.<verse eid="1KI 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18"/>Eka ruoth noloso kom loch maduongʼ ma iye obaw gi lak liech kendo ngʼeye obaw gi dhahabu mopwodhi. <verse eid="1KI 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19"/>Kom duongʼno ne nigi raidhi mag kuonde minyono auchiel kendo yo kangʼeye ne nigi wich molworore. Bethene ariyo ne nigi bede miyienge bat, ka kido mar sibuor molosi ochungʼ e bath moro ka moro. <verse eid="1KI 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20"/>Kido mar sibuoche apar gariyo nochungi e kuonde auchiel minyono kiidho kidhi e kom duongʼ ka moro ka moro ochungi e giko raidh auchiel koni gi koni. Onge pinyruoth moro amora manoseloso kom ruoth machalo kama. <verse eid="1KI 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21"/>Kikombe duto mag Ruoth Solomon nolos gi dhahabu, kod gige ot duto mokonyorego e ode mane ni e Bungu mag Lebanon nolos gi dhahabu mopwodhi. Onge gima nolos gi fedha nikech fedha nokaw ni nengone yot e kinde Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22"/>Ruoth ne nigi yiedhi mangʼeny mag ohala e nam kaachiel gi yiedhi mag jo-Hiram. Dichiel bangʼ higni adek ka higni adek negidwogo ka gitingʼo dhahabu gi fedha gi leke liech gi ongʼeche kod bimbe.<verse eid="1KI 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23"/>Ruoth Solomon ne nigi mwandu mangʼeny kod rieko moloyo ruodhi mamoko duto mag piny. <verse eid="1KI 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24"/>Pinje duto ne biro ir Solomon mondo oyud rieko mane Nyasaye oketo e chunye. <verse eid="1KI 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25"/>Higa ka higa ngʼato ka ngʼato manobiro nokelo mich kaka gik molos gi fedha kod dhahabu, kandho, gige lweny, gik mangʼwe ngʼar, farese kod punde.<verse eid="1KI 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26"/>Solomon nongʼiewo geche mag lweny kod farese; ne en gi geche mag lweny alufu achiel mia angʼwen kod farese alufu apar gariyo mane oketo e mier madongo mag geche lweny to moko bende noketo Jerusalem kama nodake. <verse eid="1KI 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27"/>Ruoth nomiyo fedha obedo manwangʼo yot ka kidi akida Jerusalem kendo yiend sida ne ngʼeny mana ka yiend ngʼowu ma otwi e got. <verse eid="1KI 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28"/>Solomon nokelo farese koa Misri kod e piny miluongo ni Kue, johala mag ruoth nongʼiewogi e piny Kue. <verse eid="1KI 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29"/>Negingʼiewo gach lweny koa Misri e nengo mar kilo abiriyo mar fedha kendo Faras achiel e nengo maromo kilo ariyo mar fedha. Bende ne giusogi ni ruodhi duto mag jo-Hiti gi jo-Aram.<verse eid="1KI 10:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Mond Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1"/>Kata kamano Ruoth Solomon nohero nyi pinje mamoko mangʼeny; mane omedo bangʼ nyar Farao kaka nyi jo-Moab gi jo-Amon gi jo-Edom gi jo-Sidon kod nyi jo-Hiti. <verse eid="1KI 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2"/>Negia e ogendini mane Jehova Nyasaye okwero jo-Israel kawacho niya, “Kik ukendru kodgi, nikech adier ginilok chunyu ma uluw nyisechegi.” Kata kamano, Solomon nomoko kuomgi gihera. <verse eid="1KI 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3"/>Ne en-gi mon mia abiriyo monywol e ut ruodhi kod mon moketo mia adek, kendo mondego nowite. <verse eid="1KI 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4"/>Kaka Solomon ne medo bedo moti, monde noloko chunye moluwo nyiseche mamoko kendo chunye ne ok ochiwore chuth ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasache, kaka chuny Daudi wuon-gi ne en. <verse eid="1KI 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5"/>Noluwo nyasaye madhako mar jo-Sidon miluongo ni Ashtoreth kod nyasach dwanyruok mar jo-Amon miluongo ni Molek. <verse eid="1KI 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6"/>Omiyo Solomon notimo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, ne ok oluwo Jehova Nyasaye gi chunye duto kaka Daudi wuon-gi notimo.<verse eid="1KI 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7"/>Ewi got moro yo wuok chiengʼ mar Jerusalem, Solomon nogero kama otingʼore gi malo ni nyasach dwanyruok mar Moab miluongo ni Kemosh kod nyasach dwanyruok mar jo-Amon miluongo ni Molek. <verse eid="1KI 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8"/>Notimo kamano ni monde mag pinje mamoko mane wangʼo ubani kendo ne chiwo misango ni nyisechegigo.<verse eid="1KI 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9"/>Jehova Nyasaye iye nowangʼ gi Solomon nikech chunye noselokore moa kuom Jehova Nyasaye Nyasach Israel mane osefwenyorene nyadiriyo. <verse eid="1KI 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10"/>Kata obedo ni notamo Solomon e luwo nyiseche mamoko Solomon ne ok orito chik Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1KI 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11"/>Omiyo Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ni Solomon niya, “Nikech ma en pachi kendo ok iserito singruokna gi buchena mane achiki, chutho abiro pogo lochni kendo abiro miyo achiel kuom jotichni. <verse eid="1KI 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12"/>Kata kamano, ok abi time e kindeni, nikech Daudi wuonu. To abiro poge e kinde wuodi. <verse eid="1KI 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13"/>To ok anamaye pinyruoth duto, to abiro miye dhoot achiel nikech Daudi jatichna kendo nikech Jerusalem, ma aseyiero.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wasik Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14"/>Eka Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo Solomon obedo gi jasigu ma ne en Hadad ja-Edom mane owuok e dhood joka ruoth mar Edom. <verse eid="1KI 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15"/>E kinde motelo kane Daudi kedo gi Edom, Joab mane jatend lweny mane odhi mondo oyik joma otho, nonego chwo duto mantie e Edom. <verse eid="1KI 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16"/>Joab kod jo-Israel duto nobedo kuno kuom dweche auchiel, nyaka negitieko chwo duto Edom. <verse eid="1KI 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17"/>To Hadad, mane pod rawera matin, noringo odhi Misri gi jodong Edom moko, mane osetiyo ni wuon-gi. <verse eid="1KI 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18"/>Ne giwuok Midian kendo negidhi Paran. Bangʼ kawo chwo mag Paran kodgi negidhi Misri, ir Farao ruodh Misri, mane omiyo Hadad ot gi lowo kod chiemo.<verse eid="1KI 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19"/>Farao ne mor ahinya gi Hadad, omiyo nokawo nyamin Tapenes ma en ruoth madhako kendo ma jaod Farao mondo obed chiege. <verse eid="1KI 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20"/>Nyamin Tapenes nonywolone wuowi miluongo ni Genubath mane Tapenes opidho e dala ruoth maduongʼ. Kanyo Genubath nodak gi nyithind Farao.<verse eid="1KI 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21"/>Kane ne en Misri, Hadad nowinjo ni Daudi noyweyo gi kwerene kendo ni Joab jatend jolweny bende nosetho. Eka Hadad nowachone Farao niya, “We adhi mondo adogi e pinywa.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22"/>To Farao nopenje niya, “Angʼo michando kae momiyo idwaro dok e pinyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Hadad to nodwoke niya, “Onge, to yie iweya aweya adhi!”<verse eid="1KI 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23"/>Kendo Nyasaye nochako omiyo Rezon wuod Eliada mane oringo oa ir ruodhe ma Hadadezer ruoth Zoba obedo jasik Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24"/>Nochoko chwo ire kendo nobedo jatend oganda kane Daudi tieko jolweny Zoba. Ogandago nodhi Damaski kuma negidakie mi giloche. <verse eid="1KI 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25"/>E kinde ngima Solomon duto Rezon nobedo jasik Israel, komedore gi chandruok mane Hadad okelo. Kamano Rezon nobedo ruodh Aram kendo noger gi jo-Israel.<verse eid="1KI 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeroboam ongʼanyo ne Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26"/>Jeroboam wuod Nebat ma ja-Efraim moa Zereda kendo ma min mare niluongo ni Zeruya ne en dhako ma chwore otho bende nongʼanyo ni ruoth. Ne en achiel kuom jodong Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27"/>Ma e kaka nongʼanyo ni ruoth: Solomon nosegero ohinga kendo nosedino otuchi duto mane ni e kor ohinga e dala maduongʼ Daudi wuon-gi <verse eid="1KI 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28"/>Koro Jeroboam ne en ngʼat momi luor kendo kane Solomon oneno kaka ngʼat matin-no timo tichne maber, nokete jatend jotich duto ma od Josef.<verse eid="1KI 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29"/>E kindeno Jeroboam ne dhi oko mar Jerusalem kendo Ahija janabi moa Shilo noromo kode e yo korwako law manyien: Kargi ji ariyogo ne gin kendgi oko mar dala, <verse eid="1KI 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30"/>kendo Ahija nokawo law mane orwako moyieche nyadipar gariyo. <verse eid="1KI 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31"/>Eka nowacho ni Jeroboam niya, “Kaw migepe apar obed magi nikech ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Nyasach Israel wacho: ‘Ne adhi pogo loch Solomon kendo adhi miyi dhoudi apar. <verse eid="1KI 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32"/>To nikech Daudi jatichna kod dala mar Jerusalem maseyiero e kind dhoudi duto mag Israel, obiro bedo gi dhoot achiel. <verse eid="1KI 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33"/>Abiro timo gini nikech gisejwangʼa mi gilamo Ashtoreth nyasaye madhako mar jo-Sidon gi Kemosh nyasach jo-Moab kod Molek nyasach jo-Amon kendo ok gisewuotho e yorena; kata timo gima kare e nyima, kata rito buchena kod chikena kaka Daudi, wuon Solomon notimo.<verse eid="1KI 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34"/>“ ‘To ok anagol loch duto e lwet Solomon, asekete jatelo ndalo duto mag ngimane nikech Daudi jatichna, mane ayiero kendo mane orito chikena kod buchena. <verse eid="1KI 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35"/>Abiro kawo loch e lwet wuode kendo anamiyi dhoudi apar. <verse eid="1KI 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36"/>Abiro miyo wuode dhoot achiel mondo Daudi jatichna obed gi taya e nyima ndalo duto e Jerusalem, dala maduongʼ mane ayiero mondo aketie Nyinga. <verse eid="1KI 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37"/>Kata kamano, nikech in, abiro kawi kendo ibiro locho kuom mago duto ma chunyi dwaro, ibiro bedo ruoth kuom Israel. <verse eid="1KI 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38"/>Kitimo duto machiki kendo iwuotho e yorena mitimo gima kare e nyima kirito buchena kod chikena, kaka Daudi jatichna notimo, to abiro bedo kodi. Abiro geroni anywola mosiko kaka nagero ni Daudi kendo anamiyi Israel. <verse eid="1KI 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39"/>Abiro boyo oganda mar Daudi nikech ma, to ok nyaka chiengʼ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40"/>Solomon notemo nego Jeroboam, to Jeroboam noringo odhi Misri ir ruoth Shishak, mobedo kuno nyaka tho Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tho mar Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41"/>Weche moko duto mag loch Solomon kaka mago mane otimo gi rieko mane onyiso donge ondikgi e kitap timbe mag Solomon? <verse eid="1KI 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42"/>Solomon nobedo ruodh jo-Israel duto ka en Jerusalem kuom higni piero angʼwen. <verse eid="1KI 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43"/>Eka notho moyweyo gi kwerene mi noyike e dala Daudi wuon-gi. Rehoboam wuode nobedo ruoth kare.<verse eid="1KI 11:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel ongʼanyo ne Rehoboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1"/>Rehoboam nodhi Shekem, nimar jo-Israel duto nodhi kuno mondo okete ruoth. <verse eid="1KI 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2"/>Kane Jeroboam wuod Nebat nowinjo wachni (ne pod en Misri kuma noringo odhiye koa kuom ruoth Solomon), noduogo koa Misri. <verse eid="1KI 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3"/>Omiyo negioro joote ir Jeroboam mi en kaachiel gi oganda duto mar Israel nodhi ir Rehoboam mi giwachone niya, <verse eid="1KI 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4"/>“Wuonu nomiyowa tingʼ mapek, to koro yie iket tingʼ mapekno kod tij achunano obednwa mayot, to wabiro tiyoni.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5"/>Rehoboam nodwoko niya, “Dhiuru kuom ndalo adek bangʼe dwoguru ira.” Bangʼe negia ma gidhi.<verse eid="1KI 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6"/>Eka Ruoth Rehoboam nonono jodongo manotiyo e bwo wuon-gi Solomon kapod ongima. Nopenjogi niya, “Ere kaka unyalo ngʼadona rieko mondo adwok jogi?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7"/>Negidwoke niya, “Ka kawuono ibiro doko jatich mar jogi mondo itinegi kendo kimiyogi dwoko mowinjore, to gibiro bedo jotichni ndalo duto.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8"/>To Rehoboam nodagi rieko mane jodongo ongʼadone kendo nopimo wach gi mbesene mane odongogo kendo ne tiyone. <verse eid="1KI 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9"/>Nopenjogi niya, “Un to uneno nangʼo? Ere kaka dwadwok jogi mawacho ni, ‘Dwok chien tingʼ mapek mane wuonu oketo kuomwa’?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10"/>Mbesene mane odongogo nodwoke niya, “Dwok jogo mosekwayi ni, ‘Wuonu noketo tingʼ mapek kuomwa, yie iket tingʼni obed mayot.’ Koro nyisgi ni, ‘Lith lweta matin duongʼ moloyo nungo wuonwa. <verse eid="1KI 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11"/>Wuonwa noketo kuomu tingʼ mapek; an to abiro medo pekne moloyo. Wuonwa nochwadou gi boka, an to abiro chwadou malit makecho ka thomoni.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12"/>Bangʼ ndalo adek Jeroboam kod oganda duto noduogo ir Rehoboam mana kaka ruoth nosewacho niya, “Dwoguru ira bangʼ ndalo adek.” <verse eid="1KI 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13"/>Ruoth nodwoko jogo gi gero. Notamore tiyo gi rieko mane jodongo ongʼadone, <verse eid="1KI 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14"/>moluwo rieko mbesene mowacho niya, “Wuonwa nomiyou tingʼ mapek, an to abiro miyou tingʼ mapek moloyo. Wuonwa nochwadou gi boka an to abiro chwadou malit ka thomoni makecho.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15"/>Omiyo ruoth ne ok odewo kwayo mar ji, nimar Jehova Nyasaye ema nomiyo mano otimore mondo ochop wach mane Jehova Nyasaye owacho gi dho Ahija ja-Shilo ne Jeroboam wuod Nebat.<verse eid="1KI 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16"/>Kane jo-Israel duto noneno ni ruoth nodagi winjo wachgi, negidwoko ruoth niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">“Wat mane moriwowa kod Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">angʼo moriwowa gi wuod Jesse?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Doguru e hembeu, yaye jo-Israel!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Rituru dhoutu uwegi, yaye oganda Daudi!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1KI 12:16">Kuom mano jo-Israel nodok e miechgi. <verse eid="1KI 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17"/>To ni jo-Israel mane odak e mier mag Juda, Rehoboam ne pod jatendgi.<verse eid="1KI 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18"/>Ruoth Rehoboam nooro Adoniram mane jarit joma ichuno mondo oti githuon, to jo-Israel duto nochiele gi kite motho. Kata kamano ruoth Rehoboam nonwangʼo thuolo moidho gache nyaka Jerusalem mondo otony. <verse eid="1KI 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19"/>Kuom mano Israel nongʼanyo ni joka Daudi nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="1KI 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20"/>Kane jo-Israel duto nowinjo ni Jeroboam ne osedwogo, ne giorone jaote ma giluonge e chokruok, kendo gikete ruodh jo-Israel duto. Mana dhood Juda kende ema nodongʼ jo-adiera ni od Daudi.<verse eid="1KI 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21"/>Kane Rehoboam ochopo Jerusalem, nochoko dhood Juda gi dhood Benjamin, chwo maromo alufu mia achiel gi piero aboro kendo gidhi giked gi jo-Israel mondo gidwok loch ni Rehoboam wuod Solomon pinyruodhe.<verse eid="1KI 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22"/>To wach Nyasaye nobiro ne Shemaya ngʼat Nyasaye niya: <verse eid="1KI 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23"/>“Wachne Rehoboam wuod Solomon ruodh Juda kaachiel gi dhood Juda kod dhood Benjamin gi oganda duto ni, <verse eid="1KI 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24"/>‘Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye owacho: Kik udhi utug lweny gi oweteu ma jo-Israel. Doguru e miechu, ngʼato ka ngʼato, nimar ma osetimore nikech an.’ ” Omiyo negiwinjo wach Jehova Nyasaye mi gidok e miechgi kaka Jehova Nyasaye nochiko.<verse eid="1KI 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyiroye mag dhahabu man Bethel gi Dan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25"/>Eka Jeroboam nochielo ohinga motegno molworo Shekem e piny manie wi gode mag Efraim mi nodak kuno. Bangʼe noa kanyo modhi mogero Peniel.<verse eid="1KI 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26"/>Jeroboam noparo kende owuon mowacho niya, “Loch nyalo dok e lwet dhood Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27"/>Ka jogi odhi e hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye man Jerusalem mondo gichiw misengini, to chunygi biro dok ni ruodhgi, ma en Rehoboam ruodh Juda. Gibiro nega mi gidog ni Ruoth Rehoboam.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28"/>Bangʼ dwaro rieko, ruoth noloso nyiroye ariyo mag dhahabu. Nowacho ni ji niya, “Ok en gima yot mondo udhi Jerusalem. Nyisecheu nika mane ogolou kua Misri, yaye Israel.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29"/>Achiel noket Bethel to machielo noket Dan. <verse eid="1KI 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30"/>Kendo gino nodoko richo; nimar ji nodhi kata mana nyaka Dan mondo gilam gimane ni kuno.<verse eid="1KI 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31"/>Jeroboam nogero kuonde mitimoe misango mane ni kuonde motingʼore kendo noyiero jodolo kuom ogendini mopogore opogore kata obedo ni ne ok gin jo-Lawi. <verse eid="1KI 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32"/>Nochako nyasi mar sawo chiengʼ mar apar gabich mar dwe mar aboro machal gi nyasi mar sawo mitimo Juda, mi notimo misengini e kendo mar misango. Ma notimo Bethel kotimo misango ni nyiroye mane oseloso. Kendo bende noketo jodolo Bethel e kuonde motingʼore mane oseloso. <verse eid="1KI 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33"/>Chiengʼ mar apar gabich mar dwe mar aboro, dwe mane oyiero en owuon, notimo misengini e kendo mar misango mane oloso Bethel. Kamano bende noketo nyasi mar sawo ni jo-Israel mi nodhi e kendo mar misango mondo otim misengini.<verse eid="1KI 12:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Ngʼat Nyasaye moa Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1"/>Kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye, ngʼat Nyasaye nobiro koa Juda modhi Bethel e kinde mane Jeroboam ochungʼ e but kendo mar misango mondo ochiw misango. <verse eid="1KI 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2"/>Noywak kokwongʼo kendo misangono kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye: “Yaye kendo mar misango! Yaye kendo mar misango! Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho, ‘Wuowi miluongo ni Josia ibiro nywol e od Daudi. Kuomi e nochiwe jodolo mag kuonde motingʼore makoro chiwo misengini kuomi, kendo choke dhano ibiro wangʼ kuomi.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3"/>Chiengʼ nogono ngʼat Nyasayeno nochiwo ranyisi: “Ma e ranyisi ma Jehova Nyasaye osechiwo: Kendo mar misango biro barore diere ariyo kendo buru man kuome biro pukore oko.”<verse eid="1KI 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4"/>Kane ruoth Jeroboam owinjo kaka ngʼat Nyasayeno noywak kokwongʼo kendo mar misango man Bethel norieyo bade kowuok e kendo mar misango kowacho niya, “Makeuru!” To bade mane orieyono kochomo ngʼat Nyasayeno notal mane ok onyal dole. <verse eid="1KI 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5"/>Kendo mar misangono bende nobarore diere ariyo kendo buru mage nopukore oko kaluwore gi ranyisi mane ochiw gi ngʼat Nyasaye kod Wach Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="1KI 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6"/>Eka ruoth nowacho ni ngʼat Nyasayeno niya, “Kwana Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi kendo lamna mondo lweta odog kare.” Kamano ngʼat Nyasayeno nokwayone Jehova Nyasaye kendo lwet ruoth nodok kare kaka ne en.<verse eid="1KI 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7"/>Ruoth nowacho ni ngʼat Nyasayeno niya, “Wadhi oda mondo iyud gimoro icham kendo abiro miyi mich.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8"/>To ngʼat Nyasaye nodwoko ruoth niya, “Kata ne bed mana ni inyalo miya nus mwanduni duto ok anadhi kodi kata chamo chiemo kata modho pi ka. <verse eid="1KI 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9"/>Nimar nochika gi wach Jehova Nyasaye ni, ‘Kik ichiem kata modho pi kata dok gi yo mane ibirogo.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10"/>Kamano nokawo yo machielo mine ok odok gi yo mane obirogo Bethel.<verse eid="1KI 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11"/>Koro ne nitie janabi moro moti mane odak Bethel ma yawuote nobiro mowachone duto mane ngʼat Nyasayeno otimo kanyo chiengʼno, bende neginyiso wuon-gi gima nowacho ni ruoth. <verse eid="1KI 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12"/>Wuon-gi nopenjogi niya, “Noluwo yo mane?” To yawuote nonyise yo mane ngʼat Nyasaye moa Juda noluwo. <verse eid="1KI 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13"/>Kamano nowacho ni yawuote niya, “Gawnauru punda.” Kane gisegawone punda, noidhe <verse eid="1KI 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14"/>mi noluwo bangʼ ngʼat Nyasayeno. Noyude kobet e tiend yiend ober mopenje niya, “In e ngʼat Nyasaye mane oa Juda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Nodwoke niya, “Ee en an.”<verse eid="1KI 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15"/>Kamano janabi nowachone niya, “Wadhi dala mondo ichiem.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16"/>Ngʼat Nyasayeno nowacho niya, “Ok anyal lokora ma adog kodi dala kata chiemo kata modho pi kodi ka. <verse eid="1KI 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17"/>Osenyisa kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye ni, ‘Kik ichiem kata kik imodh pi kanyo kata idog gi yo mane ibirogo.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18"/>To janabi motino nodwoke niya, “An bende an janabi mana kaka in. Kendo malaika nowuoyo koda gi wach Jehova Nyasaye kawachona ni, ‘Duog kode e odi mondo mi ochiem kendo omodh pi.’ ” To kata kamano nowuonde. <verse eid="1KI 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19"/>Kamano ngʼat Nyasaye noduogo kode mochiemo kendo metho e ode.<verse eid="1KI 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20"/>Kane gibedo e mesa gichiemo, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ni janabi moticha mane odwogo chien. <verse eid="1KI 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21"/>Noywak ne ngʼat Nyasaye mane oa Juda mowacho niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho: ‘Isedagi winjo wach Jehova Nyasaye kendo ok iserito chik mane Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi omiyi. <verse eid="1KI 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22"/>Nidwogo chien mi ichamo makati kendo imodho pi kama nowachoni ni kik ichiemie kata modhoe pi. Omiyo ringri ok enoyiki e kar yiko mar kwereni.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23"/>Kane ngʼat Nyasayeno otieko chiemo kendo metho, janabi mane odwoge chienno nogawone pundane. <verse eid="1KI 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24"/>Kane en e yore odhi, sibuor noromo kode e yo monege kendo ringe nowit piny e yo, ka punda kod sibuor ochungʼ bute. <verse eid="1KI 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25"/>Jomoko mane kadho machiegni noneno ringreno kowit piny kanyo, ka sibuor ochungʼ but ringruokno kendo negidhi mi gilando wachno e dala mane janabi moticha odakie.<verse eid="1KI 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26"/>Kane janabi mane odwoge chien e wuodhe owinjo ma nowacho niya, “En ngʼat Nyasaye mane ochayo wach Nyasaye. Jehova Nyasaye osechiwe ni sibuor mosekidhe kendo onege mana kaka wach Jehova Nyasaye nosesieme.”<verse eid="1KI 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27"/>Janabi nowachone yawuote niya, “Gawnauru punda kendo negitimo kamano.” <verse eid="1KI 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28"/>Eka nowuok modhi oyudo ringruokno kowit piny e yo ka punda gi sibuor ochungʼ bute. Sibuor ne ok ochamo ngʼatno kata kidho punda. <verse eid="1KI 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29"/>Kamano janabino nokawo ringre ngʼat Nyasayeno mokete e ngʼe punda kendo nodwoge e dalane mondo oywage kendo oike. <verse eid="1KI 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30"/>Eka noketo ringreno e kar bure owuon mi giywage kagiwacho niya, “Yaye, owadwa!”<verse eid="1KI 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31"/>Bangʼ yike nowacho ni yawuote niya, “Katho to ikauru e bur kama oyikie ngʼat Nyasayeni; keturu chokena but chokene. <verse eid="1KI 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32"/>Nikech wach mane owacho kuluworegi wach Jehova Nyasaye kuom kendo mar misango man Bethel kendo kwongʼ mane okwongʼogo kuonde duto motingʼore malo mitimoe misango manie dala man Samaria biro chopo kare.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33"/>Kata mana bangʼ ma, Jeroboam ne ok oloko yorene maricho to nomedo yiero jodolo koa kuom ji mopogore opogore mondo oti kuonde motingʼore. Ngʼato angʼata mane dwaro bedo jadolo nowalo ni kuonde motingʼore. <verse eid="1KI 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34"/>Ma e richo mar od Jeroboam mane omiyo opodho kendo kelone kethruok e wangʼ piny.<verse eid="1KI 13:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Wach mane Ahija okoro kuom Jeroboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1"/>E kindeno Abija wuod Jeroboam nobedo matuo, <verse eid="1KI 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2"/>kendo Jeroboam nowacho ni chiege niya, “Dhiyo, iwuondri mondo kik ngʼato fweny ni in chi Jeroboam, kendo dhi nyaka Shilo nimar Ahija janabi nikuro, en ema nonyisa ni anabed ruodh jogi. <verse eid="1KI 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3"/>Kaw makati apar gi kek moko kod chupa mar mor kich kendo dhi ire. Obiro nyisi gima biro timore ni nyathino.” <verse eid="1KI 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4"/>Omiyo chi Jeroboam notimo kaka nonyise modhi e od Ahija man Shilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:4">Ahija ne muofu ma ok nyal neno, nikech ne oseti. <verse eid="1KI 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5"/>To Jehova Nyasaye nosewacho ni Ahija niya, Chi Jeroboam biro penji kuom wuode, nimar otuo kendo nyaka imiye dwoko machalo kama kata kamacha. Kochopo to obiro wuondore ni en ngʼat machielo.<verse eid="1KI 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6"/>Kamano kane Ahija owinjo tiende e dhoot nowacho niya, “Donji, chi Jeroboam. En angʼo momiyo iwuondori? Oseora iri gi wach marach. <verse eid="1KI 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7"/>Dhiyo, inyis Jeroboam ni ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Nyasach Israel owacho, ‘Ne ayieri e kind ji duto mi aketi jatend joga Israel. <verse eid="1KI 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8"/>Ne apogo pinyruoth koa e od Daudi mi amiyi, to ok isebedo kaka jatichna Daudi mane orito chikena kendo noluwa gi chunye duto kotimo mana gima kare e nyima. <verse eid="1KI 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9"/>Isetimo richo moloyo ji duto mane odak kapok idak. Iseloso ne in iwuon nyiseche mamoko, nyiseche mag chuma; isemiyo iya owangʼ mi idhira ka ngʼeyi.<verse eid="1KI 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10"/>“ ‘Kuom mano, adhi kelo chandruok ne od Jeroboam. Abiro ngʼado yawuowi duto mawuok e od Jeroboam man Israel bed ni gin wasumbini kata ok gin wasumbini. Abiro wangʼo od Jeroboam mana kaka ngʼato wangʼo owuoyo nyaka oliel duto. <verse eid="1KI 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11"/>Guogi biro chamo joka Jeroboam motho e dala maduongʼ kendo winy mae kor polo biro chamo mago motho e pap. Jehova Nyasaye osewacho!’<verse eid="1KI 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12"/>“To in, dogi dala, ka inyono dala. Ka inyono dala maduongʼ, to nyathino notho. <verse eid="1KI 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13"/>Israel duto biro ywage mi ike. En kende e jaka Jeroboam mibiro iki, nikech en kende ema en e od Jeroboam ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel oseyudoe gimoro maber.<verse eid="1KI 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14"/>“Jehova Nyasaye biro yiero ni en owuon ruoth ni jo-Israel mabiro tieko dhood joka Jeroboam. Ma e odiechiengʼ! Angʼo? Ee, kata mana sani. <verse eid="1KI 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15"/>Kendo Jehova Nyasaye biro goyo Israel, mochal mana gi odundu ma yamo tero ewi pi. Obiro pudho Israel oko kogologi e piny maber mane omiyo kweregi mi okegi loka Aora nikech negimiyo Jehova Nyasaye mirima ka giloso ludhe mag Ashera. <verse eid="1KI 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16"/>Nojwangʼ Israel nikech richo mane Jeroboam otimo kendo mosemiyo Israel otimo.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17"/>Eka chi Jeroboam noa malo modhi Tirza. E kinde mane ochopo e laru mar dino cham, nyathino notho. <verse eid="1KI 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18"/>Ne giike kendo Israel duto noywage mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye nosewacho kaluwore gi dho jatichne janabi Ahija.<verse eid="1KI 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19"/>Timbe mamoko mag loch Jeroboam kaka lwenje mane okedo kod kaka nobedo e loch ondiki e kitepe mag rapar mag ruodhi mag Israel. <verse eid="1KI 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20"/>Nobedo e loch kuom higni piero ariyo gariyo bangʼe to noyweyo gi kwerene. Kendo Nabad wuode nokawo lochne.<verse eid="1KI 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam ruodh Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21"/>Rehoboam wuod Solomon ne ruoth e Juda. Ne en ja-higni piero angʼwen gachiel kane obedo ruoth, kendo nobedo e loch kuom higni apar gabiriyo e Jerusalem, e dala maduongʼ mane Jehova Nyasaye oseyiero kuom dhoudi duto mag Israel mondo oketie Nyinge. Nying min-gi ne en Naama nyar jo-Amon.<verse eid="1KI 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22"/>Juda notimo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. Kuom richo mane gitimo, negimiyo Nyasaye mirima omako kodgi moloyo kaka kweregi notimo. <verse eid="1KI 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23"/>Bende negilosone gin giwegi kuonde motingʼore, kite milamo kod yiende mag Ashera ewi gode maboyo kendo e bwo yiende motarore. <verse eid="1KI 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24"/>Bende ne nitie kata mana chwo materore kuonde lemo e pinyno, ne nitie kendo ji notimo timbe dwanyruok mag ogendini mane Jehova Nyasaye oriembo oko e nyim jo-Israel.<verse eid="1KI 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25"/>E higa mar abich mar loch ruoth Rehoboam, Shishak ruodh Misri nomonjo Jerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26"/>Noyako mwandu hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye kaachiel gi mwandu mag od ruoth. Nokawo gimoro amora, kaachiel gi kuodi mag dhahabu mane Solomon ochuogo. <verse eid="1KI 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27"/>Omiyo ruoth Rehoboam nochwogo okumbni mag nyinyo mondo oket kar mane okawgo kendo nomiyo jotelo mag jorit mane rito rangach midonjogo e dala ruoth. <verse eid="1KI 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28"/>E kinde moro amora mane ruoth dhi e hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye, joritogo ne tingʼo kuodigo kendo bangʼe negidwokogi e od jorito.<verse eid="1KI 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29"/>Kuom weche mamoko mag loch Rehoboam, kaachiel gi gik moko duto mane otimo, donge ondikgi e kitap rapar mag ruodhi mag Juda? <verse eid="1KI 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30"/>Ne nitiere lweny ma ok rum e kind Rehoboam gi Jeroboam. <verse eid="1KI 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31"/>Rehoboam notho kaka kwerene kendo noyike kodgi e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi. Nying min-gi ne en Naama; ma nyar jo-Amon. Abija wuode nobedo ruoth kare.<verse eid="1KI 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Abija ruodh Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1"/>E higa mar apar gaboro mar loch Jeroboam wuod Nebat, Abija nobedo ruodh Juda, <verse eid="1KI 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2"/>kendo norito piny kuom higni adek kodak Jerusalem. Min mare ne nyinge Maaka nyar Abishalom.<verse eid="1KI 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3"/>Notimo richo duto mane wuon otimo kendo chunye ne ok ochiwore chuth ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasache, kaka chuny Daudi kwargi ne en. <verse eid="1KI 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4"/>To kata kamano nikech Daudi, Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasache nomiye taya Jerusalem koyiero wuode mondo okaw lochne kendo oket Jerusalem obed motegno. <verse eid="1KI 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5"/>Nikech Daudi notimo gima kare e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kendo ne ok oweyo ma ok omako chik Jehova Nyasaye moro amora e ndalo ngimane duto makmana e wach Uria ja-Hiti.<verse eid="1KI 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6"/>Lweny ne nitie e kind Rehoboam gi Jeroboam e kinde duto mar ngima Abija. <verse eid="1KI 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7"/>To timbe mamoko mag loch Abija kaachiel gi gik moko duto mane otimo, donge ondikgi e kitepe mag weche mag ndalo mar ruodhi mag Juda? Ne nitie lweny e kind Abija kod Jeroboam. <verse eid="1KI 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8"/>Kendo Abija notho kaka kwerene kendo noyike e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi. Asa wuode nobedo ruoth kare.<verse eid="1KI 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asa ruodh Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9"/>E higa mar piero ariyo mar loch Jeroboam ruodh Israel, Asa nobedo ruodh Juda, <verse eid="1KI 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10"/>kendo nobedo ruoth Jerusalem kuom higni piero angʼwen gachiel. Dagi niluongo ni Maaka nyar Abishalom.<verse eid="1KI 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11"/>Asa notimo gima kare e nyim Jehova Nyasaye mana kaka Daudi wuon mare notimo. <verse eid="1KI 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12"/>Noriembo chwo ma jochode mag kuonde lemo modarogi e pinye kendo noketho nyiseche manono mane kweregi oloso. <verse eid="1KI 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13"/>Bende nogolo dagi ma Maaka e kome mane entie kaka min ruoth nikech noloso sirni milamo mar Ashera. Asa nongʼado yien-no mowangʼe e holo mar Kidron. <verse eid="1KI 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14"/>Kata obedo ni Asa ne ok oketho kuonde motingʼore malo mag lemo, chunye nochiwore chutho ni Jehova Nyasaye ndalo duto mag ngimane. <verse eid="1KI 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15"/>Nokelo gige dhahabu gi fedha kod mula e hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye ma en owuon gi wuon mare nosepwodho.<verse eid="1KI 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16"/>Ne nitie lweny e kind Asa kod Baasha ruodh Israel ndalo duto mag lochgi. <verse eid="1KI 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17"/>Baasha ruodh Israel nodhi kedo kod Juda kendo nochielo Rama motegno mondo ogengʼ ni ngʼato angʼata kik wuogi kata donji e piny Asa ruodh Juda.<verse eid="1KI 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18"/>Eka Asa nokawo fedha gi dhahabu duto mane odongʼ e ute keno mag hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye gi mago mag ode. Nomiyogi jodonge mi oorogi ir Ben-Hadad wuod Tabrimon ma wuod Hezion ruodh Aram manodak Damaski. <verse eid="1KI 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19"/>Nowachone niya, “Winjruok mondo obedie kindi koda, mana kaka nobedo e kind wuonwa gi wuonu. Aoroni mich mag fedha gi dhahabu, koro keth winjruok mantie e kindi gi Baasha ruodh Israel mondo mi owe kedo koda.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20"/>Ben-Hadad noyie gi ruoth Asa kendo nooro jotende mag lweny mondo omonj mier matindo mag Israel. Noloyo Ijon gi Dan gi Abel Beth Maaka kod Kinereth duto kaachiel gi Naftali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21"/>Kane Baasha owinjo mano, nochungo gero Rama modok Tirza. <verse eid="1KI 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22"/>Eka ruoth Asa nochiwo chik ni Juda duto maonge ngʼato angʼata mane owe oko, negikawo kite duto kod yiende mane Baasha osebedo katiyogo Rama kendo notiyo kodgi kanyo. Asa notiyo kodgi kuom gero Geba e piny Benjamin kod Mizpa bende.<verse eid="1KI 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23"/>Weche mamoko duto mag loch Asa, gi lochne, gi gigo duto mane otimo gi mier duto mane ogero donge ondikgi e kitepe mag ruodhi mag Juda? Kata kamano ka hike noseniangʼ tiende nobedo gituo. <verse eid="1KI 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24"/>Eka Asa noyweyo gi kwerene kendo noyike kodgi e dala Daudi wuon mare. Kendo Jehoshafat wuode nobedo ruoth kare.<verse eid="1KI 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nadab ruodh Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25"/>Nadab wuod Jeroboam nobedo ruoth mar Israel e higa mar ariyo mar loch Asa ruodh Juda, kendo nobedo ruodh Israel kuom higni ariyo. <verse eid="1KI 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26"/>Notimo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kowuotho e yor wuon mare kod richone mane omiyo Israel otimo.<verse eid="1KI 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27"/>Baasha wuod Ahija ja-dhood Isakar nomonje mi nogoye monege e Gibethon e dala jo-Filistia ka Nadab kod jo-Israel duto ne dwaro monjo dalano. <verse eid="1KI 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28"/>Baasha nonego Nadab e higa mar adek mar loch Asa ruodh Juda, kendo nokaw lochne kaka ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29"/>Mapiyo piyo kochako locho, nonego jood Jeroboam duto. Ne ok oweyo ni Jeroboam kata ngʼato achiel mayweyo to notiekogi kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye mane omiyo jatichne Ahija ja-Shilo; <verse eid="1KI 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30"/>nikech richo mane Jeroboam otimo kendo mane omiyo Israel otimo, kendo nikech nomiyo Jehova Nyasaye Nyasach Israel obedo gi mirima.<verse eid="1KI 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31"/>To kuom mamoko mag loch Nadab kaachiel gi timbene duto donge ondiki e kitepe mag ruodhi mag Israel? <verse eid="1KI 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32"/>Ne nitie lweny e kind Asa kod Baasha ruodh Israel ndalo duto mag lochgi.<verse eid="1KI 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baasha ruodh Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33"/>E higa mar adek mar loch Asa ruodh Juda, Baasha wuod Ahija nodoko ruoth kuom Israel duto e Tirza kendo nobedo ruoth kuom higni piero ariyo gangʼwen. <verse eid="1KI 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34"/>Notimo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kowuotho e yore mag Jeroboam kod richone mane omiyo Israel otimo.<verse eid="1KI 15:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1"/>Eka wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ni Jehu wuod Hanani kuom Baasha mowachone niya, “Nayieri.” <verse eid="1KI 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2"/>Ne atingʼi malo ka agoli e buru mi aketi jatend joga Israel to niwuotho e yore mag Jeroboam mi nimiyo joga Israel otimo richo kendo ne uchwanya mi imiyo abet gi mirima nikech richo magu. <verse eid="1KI 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3"/>Omiyo koro achiegni tieko Baasha kod ode kendo abiro keto odi kaka mano mar Jeroboam wuod Nebat. <verse eid="1KI 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4"/>Guogi biro chamo joka Baasha motho e mier madongo, kendo winy mae kor polo biro chamo mago motho e pewe.<verse eid="1KI 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5"/>Timbe duto mag loch Baasha gi gik mane otimo, donge ondikgi e kitepe ruodhi mag Israel? <verse eid="1KI 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6"/>Baasha noyweyo gi kwerene mi noyike Tirza. Kendo Ela wuode nokawo lochne kaka ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7"/>Kata kamano, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro gi dho janabi Jehu wuod Hanani ni Baasha kod ode, nikech richo duto mane osetimo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, komiye mirima gi gik moko mane osetimo, kendo kobedo machal gi od Jeroboam, kendo bende nikech mano nokethe.<verse eid="1KI 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ela ruodh Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8"/>E higa mar piero ariyo gauchiel mar loch Asa Ruodh Juda, Ela wuod Baasha nodoko ruodh Israel kendo nobedo ruodh Tirza kuom higni ariyo.<verse eid="1KI 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9"/>Achiel kuom jotende miluongo ni Zimri mane otelo ni nus gechene nochano mar nege. Ela ne nitie Tirza e kindeno, komer e dala Arza, ngʼat motelo ni od ruoth man Tirza. <verse eid="1KI 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10"/>Zimri nodonjo e ot mogoye kendo onege e higa mar piero ariyo gabiriyo mar loch Asa ruodh Juda, kendo nokawo lochne kaka ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11"/>Mapiyo ka osechako locho kendo mobetie e kom loch, nonego anywola Baasha duto. Ne ok ongʼwono kata ni nyathi ma wuowi, bed ni ne en wat kata osiep. <verse eid="1KI 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12"/>Omiyo Zimri noketho od Baasha, kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye mane owacho ni Baasha kawuok kuom Jehu janabi <verse eid="1KI 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13"/>nikech richo duto mane Baasha kod wuode Ela nosetimo kendo mane gimiyo Israel otimo, omiyo ne giwangʼo ii Jehova Nyasaye, Nyasach Israel, ka gimiye mirima gi nyiseche manono.<verse eid="1KI 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14"/>Timbe mamoko mag loch Ela kaachiel gi gik moko duto mane otimo, donge ondikgi e kitap rapar mag ruodhi mag Israel?<verse eid="1KI 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zimri ruodh Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15"/>E higa mar piero ariyo gabiriyo mar Asa ruodh Juda, Zimri nobedo ruodh Tirza kuom ndalo abiriyo. Jolweny nogoyo kambi but Gibethon e dala mar jo-Filistia. <verse eid="1KI 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16"/>Kane jo-Israel mane ni e kambi nowinjo ni Zimri osemonjo ruoth mi onege, negiketo ni Omri ma jatend jolweny, mondo obedo ruoth mar Israel mana gi chiengʼno. <verse eid="1KI 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17"/>Eka Omri gi jo-Israel duto mane ni kode nowuok Gibethon mi gimonjo Tirza. <verse eid="1KI 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18"/>Kane Zimri oneno ni dalano osekaw, nodhi kama tek mar dala ruoth, nomoko dalano mach molwore. Mine otho, <verse eid="1KI 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19"/>nikech richo mane otimo, kotimo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kendo kowuotho e yore Jeroboam kendo e richo mane otimo, kod mago mane omiyo jo-Israel otimo.<verse eid="1KI 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20"/>Timbe mamoko mag loch Zimri gi ngʼanyo mane obedogo, donge ondikgi e kitepe mag rapar mag ruodhi Israel?<verse eid="1KI 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omri ruodh Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21"/>Eka jo-Israel nopogore e migepe ariyo; migawo achiel ne chwako Tibni wuod Ginath kaka ruoth, to migawo machielo ne chwako Omri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22"/>To joma ne luwo Omri ne onyisore ni gin giteko moloyo mago mag Tibni wuod Ginath. Kamano Tibni notho to Omri nodoko ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23"/>E higa mar piero adek gachiel mar loch Asa ruodh Juda, Omri nobedo ruodh Israel, nobedo ruoth kuom higni apar gariyo, ka auchiel kuomgi en Tirza. <verse eid="1KI 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24"/>Nongʼiewo gode mag Samaria gi Shemer gi fedha ma dirom kilo piero abiriyo kendo mogero dala maduongʼ e got, miluongo ni Samaria, kochake Shemer nying wuon godno.<verse eid="1KI 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25"/>To Omri notimo timbe mamono e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kendo notimo richo mathoth moloyo joma notelo ne. <verse eid="1KI 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26"/>Nowuotho e yore duto mag Jeroboam wuod Nebat kod richone mane omiyo jo-Israel otimo, mine gimiyo Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel mirima gi nyisechegi manono.<verse eid="1KI 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27"/>Timbe mamoko mag loch Omri gi gik mabeyo mane otimo, donge ondikgi e kitap rapar mar ruodhi mag Israel? <verse eid="1KI 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28"/>Omri noyweyo gi kwerene mi noyike Samaria, kendo Ahab wuode nokawo lochne kaka ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahab obedo ruodh Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29"/>E higa mar piero adek gaboro mar loch Asa ruodh Juda, Ahab wuod Omri nobedo ruodh Israel, kendo nobedo ruodh Israel kuom higni piero ariyo gariyo kodak Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30"/>Ahab wuod Omri notimo timbe mamono mangʼeny e nyim Jehova Nyasaye moloyo joma notelo ne. <verse eid="1KI 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31"/>Ok nine oluwo richo mag Jeroboam wuod Nebat kende, to bende nine okendo Jezebel nyar Ethbal ruodh Sidon mi nochako tiyo ni Baal kendo lame. <verse eid="1KI 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32"/>Ne oloso kendo mar misango ne Baal e hekalu mar Baal mane osegero e Samaria <verse eid="1KI 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33"/>Ahab bende noloso siro mar Ashera kendo notimo mangʼeny mamoko mondo ochwanygo Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, kendo owangʼ iye moloyo ruodhi duto mag Israel mane nitiere motelone.<verse eid="1KI 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34"/>E kinde Ahab, Hiel ja-Bethel nochako gero Jeriko kendo. Noketo misene mi wuode makayo miluongo ni Abiram notho kendo kane oguro dhorangeye to wuode ma chogo miluongo ni Segub bende notho, mana kaka wach Jehova Nyasaye mane owacho gi dho Joshua wuod Nun.<verse eid="1KI 16:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Elija olando ni oro maduongʼ biro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1"/>Koro Elija ja-Tishbi moa Tishbe e piny Gilead nonyiso Ahab niya, “Mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye mangima, ma Nyasach Israel matiyone nitie, tho kata koth ok nobedi kuom higni manok nyaka chop achak awach kendo.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agak omiyo Elija chiemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2"/>Eka wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ne Elija mowachone niya, <verse eid="1KI 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3"/>“Aa ka, dhi yo wuok chiengʼ kendo ipondi e holo mar Kerith man yo wuok chiengʼ mar Jordan. <verse eid="1KI 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4"/>Ibiro modho pi mowuok e soko kendo asechiko winyo mag agak mondo omiyi chiemo kanyo.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5"/>Kamano notimo gima Jehova Nyasaye nochike. Nodhi e holo mar Kerith yo ka wuok chiengʼ mar aora Jordan kendo nobedo kuno. <verse eid="1KI 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6"/>Winyo mag agakgo nokelone kuon gi ringʼo okinyi godhiambo to nomodho e sokono.<verse eid="1KI 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Elija kod dhako ma chwore otho man Zarefath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7"/>Bangʼ kinde moko sokono notwo nikech koth ne pok ochuwe e piny. <verse eid="1KI 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8"/>Eka wach Jehova Nyasaye nobirone mowachone niya, <verse eid="1KI 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9"/>“Dhiyo piyo piyo nyaka Zarefath e piny Sidon kendo ibed kanyo. Asechiko dhako ma chwore otho moro kanyo mondo omiyi chiemo.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10"/>Kamano nodhi Zarefath. Kane ochopo e dhoranga dalano, dhako ma chwore otho moro ne ni kanyo ka choko yien. Noluonge mopenje niya, “Bende inyalo kelonae pi matin e agwata agulu mondo amodhi?” <verse eid="1KI 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11"/>Kane odhi kelo pi, Elija noluonge mowachone niya, “Kendo kiyie, to kelna kuon matin.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12"/>Eka nodwoko Elija niya, “Mana kaka Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachi ngima aonge gi kuon moro amora makmana mogo matin e agulu kod mo matin e puga. Amodo yien matin mondo ater dala kendo alosgo chiemba kod mar wuoda mondo wacham bangʼe watho.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13"/>Elija nowachone niya, “Kik ibed maluor dhi dala kendo tim kaka isewacho. To mokwongo losna kuon matin kuom gima in-go mondo ikelna eka ilos gimoro ni in kaachiel gi wuodi <verse eid="1KI 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14"/>Nimar ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye Nyasach Israel wacho, ‘Agulu mar mogo ok nodongʼ nono kendo puga mar mo ok notwo nyaka chop chiengʼ ma Jehova Nyasaye nokelie koth, e piny.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15"/>Nodhi motimo kaka Elija nowachone. Kamano ne nitie chiemo pile ka pile ne Elija gi dhakono kod joode. <verse eid="1KI 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16"/>Nimar agulu mar mogono ne ok odongʼ nono kendo puga mar mo-no ne ok otwo kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye mane Elija owacho.<verse eid="1KI 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17"/>Bangʼ kinde moko wuod dhakoni ma wuon odno ne tuo, nomedo bedo marach ahinya to bangʼe notho. <verse eid="1KI 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18"/>Dhakono nopenjo Elija niya, “En rach mane ma in-go koda, ngʼat Nyasaye? Ne ibiro mondo iparna richona kendo mondo ineg wuoda?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19"/>Elija nodwoke niya, “Miya wuodi.” Nokawe koa e lwete motingʼe nyaka ei ot mamalo mane odakie mopiele e kitandane. <verse eid="1KI 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20"/>Eka noywak ne Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Yaye Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasacha isekelo chandruok bende ni dhako ma chwore otho madakgo ni kimiyo wuode tho?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21"/>Eka noriere kuom wuowino nyadidek moywak ni Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasacha yie ngima wuowini oduogne!”<verse eid="1KI 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowinjo ywak Elija mi ngima wuowino noduogone mi nobedo mangima. <verse eid="1KI 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23"/>Elija nochungo nyathino motingʼe kogole oko ewi tado motere e ot. Nomiye min-gi mowachone niya ne wuodi ngima!<verse eid="1KI 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24"/>Eka dhakono nowacho ni Elija niya, “Koro angʼeyo adiera ni in ngʼat Nyasaye kendo ni wach Jehova Nyasaye mawuok e dhogi en adiera.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Elija gi Obadia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1"/>Bangʼ ndalo mangʼeny, e higa mar adek, wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ne Elija mowachone niya, “Dhiyo mondo inyisri ni Ahab kendo abiro kelo koth e piny.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2"/>Omiyo Elija nodhi monyisore ne Ahab.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Koro kech ne lich ahinya e piny Samaria, <verse eid="1KI 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3"/>kendo Ahab noseluongo Obadia mane otelo ne dala ruoth maduongʼ. Obadia ne en ngʼat man-gi yie motegno kuom Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1KI 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4"/>Kane Jezebel nego jonabi mag Jehova Nyasaye, Obadia nokawo jonabi mia achiel mopandogi e buche mag pondo ariyo ka ji piero abich abich e moro ka moro kendo nomiyogi pi gi chiemo. <verse eid="1KI 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5"/>Ahab nosewacho ne Obadia niya, “Dhi e piny duto e sokni kod holo duto. Dipo ka wayudo lum mondo farese kod kenje obed mangima mondo kik waneg chiachwa moro amora.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6"/>Omiyo negipogo piny mane gi dhi wuothoe, ka Ahab ochomo konchiel to Obadia ochomo komachielo.<verse eid="1KI 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7"/>Kane Obadia wuotho, Elija noromo kode. Obadia nonene mongʼeye kendo nokulore nyaka e lowo mowacho niya, “Bende en in adier Elija ruodha?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8"/>Elija to nodwoke niya, “Ee. Dhiyo inyis ruodhi ni, ‘Elija nika.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9"/>Obadia to nopenje niya, “En angʼo masetimo marach makoro omiyo ichiwo jatichni ni Ahab mondo onegi? <verse eid="1KI 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10"/>Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni onge piny moro kata pinyruoth moro ma ruodha pok oseore ngʼato mondo omanyi. To e kinde moro amora mane piny moro kata pinyruoth moro owacho ni ionge kuno, nomiyo gikwongʼore ni ne ok ginyal yudi. <verse eid="1KI 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11"/>To koro inyisa mondo adhi ir ruodha mondo anyise ni, ‘Elija ni ka.’ <verse eid="1KI 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12"/>Ok angʼeyo kama Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nyalo tingʼi ma terie bangʼ kasedhi. Ka adhi ma anyiso Ahab mi ok oyudi to obiro nega. To an jatichni aselamo Jehova Nyasaye ae tin-na. <verse eid="1KI 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13"/>Donge isewinjo, ruodha gima natimo kane Jezebel nego jonabi mag Jehova Nyasaye? Napando jonabi mia achiel mag Jehova Nyasaye e buche mag pondo ariyo, ka apogogi piero abich abich mi amiyogi chiemo gi pi. <verse eid="1KI 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14"/>To koro inyisa mondo adhi ir ruodha kendo awachne ni, ‘Elija ni ka.’ Donge ingʼeyo ni obiro nega!”<verse eid="1KI 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15"/>Elija nodwoke niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye Maratego, matiyone, ni adier kawuononi nyaka adhi e nyim Ahab.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Elija ewi Got Karmel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16"/>Omiyo Obadia nodhi romo ne Ahab monyise ni Elija ni ka. Omiyo Ahab nodhi oromo ne Elija. <verse eid="1KI 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17"/>Kane oneno Elija, nowachone niya, “Mano en in, jakel chandruok ni Israel-ni?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18"/>Elija nodwoke niya, “Ok asekelo chandruok e Israel. To in gi odi ema isejwangʼo chike Jehova Nyasaye mi iluwo Baal. <verse eid="1KI 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19"/>Koro luong jo-Israel duto mondo orom koda e Got Karmel. Kendo kel jodolo mag Baal mia angʼwen gi piero abich kod jonabi mia angʼwen mag Ashera, machiemo e mesa Jezebel.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20"/>Omiyo Ahab nooro wach e Israel duto mi nochoko jonabi ewi Got Karmel. <verse eid="1KI 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21"/>Elija nodhi mochungʼ e nyim ji mowachonegi niya, “Nyaka karangʼo ma ubiro digni e kind paro ariyo? Ka Jehova Nyasaye en Nyasaye, luweuru, to ka Baal en nyasaye luweuru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:21">To ji ne olingʼ thi.<verse eid="1KI 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22"/>Eka Elija nowachonegi niya, “An kende ema adongʼ kuom jonabi mag Jehova Nyasaye to Baal nigi jonabi mia angʼwen kod piero abich. <verse eid="1KI 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23"/>Yudnwauru rwedhi ariyo. We giyier moro kendgi obed margi, gingʼadgi lemo lemo mi giketgi ewi yien to kik gimok mach kuome. An bende anaik rwath machielo makete ewi yien to ok anamok mach kuome. <verse eid="1KI 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24"/>Eka uluong nying nyasachu kendo an bende abiro luongo nying Jehova Nyasaye. Nyasaye modwoko gi mach en e Nyasaye madier.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Eka ji duto nowacho niya, “Gima iwachono ber.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25"/>Elija nowacho ni jonabi mag Baal niya, “Yieruru achiel kuom rwedhigo kendo loseuru mokwongo nikech ungʼeny ahinya. Luonguru nying nyasachu to kik umok mach.” <verse eid="1KI 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26"/>Omiyo negikawo rwath mane omigi mi gilose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:26">Eka negiluongo nying Baal chakre okinyi nyaka odiechiengʼ tir ka gikok niya, “Yaye Baal, dwokwa!” To ne onge dwoko, onge ngʼama nodwoko. Kendo ne gimiel ka gilworo kendo mar misango mane giseloso.<verse eid="1KI 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27"/>Kar odiechiengʼ tir, Elija nojarogi kawacho niya, “Koguru matek moloyo!” Adier en nyasaye! Sa moro en e paro matut; kata odich kata odhi wuoth! Kamoro dipo ka onindo matut manyaka chiewe. <verse eid="1KI 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28"/>Omiyo negimedo kok matek mi gingʼolore gi ligangla kod tonge, kaka ne en timgi nyaka rembgi nomol. <verse eid="1KI 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29"/>Odiechiengʼ tir nokalo kendo negidhi nyime ka gikoro kendo gidhum nyaka nochopo kinde mar misango mar odhiambo. To ne onge dwoko, kata ngʼama nodwoko kata ngʼama nowinjogi.<verse eid="1KI 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30"/>Eka Elija nowacho ni ji duto niya, “Biuru ira ka.” Negibiro ire mi nochako loso kendo mar misango mar Jehova Nyasaye mane osekethore. <verse eid="1KI 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31"/>Elija nokawo kite apar gariyo, ka moro ka moro ochungʼ ni dhood Israel mane owuok kuom Jakobo, mane Jehova Nyasaye owachonegi niya, “Nyingi nobed Israel.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32"/>Gi kitego nogero kendo mar misango e nying Jehova Nyasaye; kendo nokunyo bugo molwore matut manyalo tingʼo pi maromo lita apar gabich. <verse eid="1KI 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33"/>Nochano yien, mongʼado rwadhno e lemo lemo mokete e yien. Eka nowachonegi niya, “Pongʼuru dopige angʼwen mag pi mondo uolie misango kod yien.”<verse eid="1KI 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34"/>Nomedo wachonegi niya, “Timuru kamano kendo mine gitimo kamano kendo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:34">Eka nogolo chik kowacho niya, “Timeuru mar adek” mine gitime mar adek. <verse eid="1KI 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35"/>Pi nomol molworo kendo mar misango kendo nopongʼo kata mana okuta.<verse eid="1KI 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36"/>E kinde mar chiwo misango, Elija janabi nosudo nyime molemo kowacho niya, “Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, Nyasach Ibrahim gi Isaka kod Israel, we ongʼere kawuono ni in e Nyasaye e Israel kendo ni an jatichni bende ni asetimo magi duto kaluwore gi chikni. <verse eid="1KI 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37"/>Dwoka, yaye Jehova Nyasaye, dwoka mondo jogi ongʼe ni in Nyasaye, yaye Jehova Nyasaye, kendo ni iloko chunygi mondo oduog iri kendo.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38"/>Eka mach mar Jehova Nyasaye nolwar kendo nowangʼo misango gi yien gi kite kod lowo notwoyo pi mane nitie e bugo.<verse eid="1KI 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39"/>Kane ji duto oneno mano, negipodho auma mi giywak kagiwacho niya, “Jehova Nyasaye e Nyasaye! Jehova Nyasaye en Nyasaye!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40"/>Eka Elija nochikogi kawacho niya, “Makuru jonabi mag Baal. Kik uwe ngʼato tony!” Ne gimakogi mi Elija nochiwo chik mondo tergi Holo mar Kishon kendo nonegogi kuro.<verse eid="1KI 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41"/>Kendo Elija nowacho ni Ahab niya, “Dhi ichiem kendo imethi nikech nitie mor koth maduongʼ kawuono.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42"/>Omiyo Ahab nodhi mochiemo kendo metho, to Elija noidho ewi Got Karmel mokulore piny kendo osoyo wiye e kind chonge.<verse eid="1KI 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43"/>Nowacho ni jatichne niya, “Dhiyo mondo ingʼi yo ka nam.” Kendo nodhi mongʼiyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Noduogo mowacho niya, “Ok aneno gimoro kanyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Elija nowachone nyadibiriyo niya, “Dogi mondo ingʼi.”<verse eid="1KI 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44"/>E ndalo mar abiriyo jatijno nowacho niya, “Bor polo matin machalo gi lwet dhano kowuok e nam.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Omiyo Elija nowacho niya, “Dhiyo mondo inyis Ahab ni, ‘Idh gachi kendo dhiyo kapok koth ogengʼoni.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45"/>To kata kamano polo nodudo kendo yamo nokudho mi koth maduongʼ nochako oo kendo Ahab nodhi Jezreel. <verse eid="1KI 18:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46"/>Teko Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kuom Elija kendo kokunjo kandhone ei okandane, noringo e nyim Ahab nyaka negichopo Jezreel.<verse eid="1KI 18:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Elija oringo odhi Horeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1"/>Koro Ahab nonyiso Jezebel mago duto mane Elija nosetimo kendo kaka nosenego jonabi gi ligangla, <verse eid="1KI 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2"/>omiyo Jezebel nooro jaote ir Elija mondo owachne niya, “Mad nyiseche timna kata bedi ni en malit machalo nade ka kiny sa ma kama ok atimo ni ngimani machal gi achiel kuom jonabigo.”<verse eid="1KI 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3"/>Elija ne luor kendo noringo nikech ngimane. Kane obiro Bersheba e Juda, noweyo jatichne kanyo, <verse eid="1KI 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4"/>ka en to nodhi e wuodh ndalo achiel e thim. Nochopo e tiend yien ma wiye opedhore mobedo e tiende kendo nolamo ni mad otho. Nowacho niya, “Jehova Nyasaye, aseneno moroma, kaw ngimana, ok aber moloyo kwerena.” <verse eid="1KI 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5"/>Eka nonindo e tiend yien ma nindo otere.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:5">Mapiyo piyo nono malaika nomule mowachone niya, “Chungʼ malo mondo ichiem.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6"/>Nongʼicho kendo noyudo makati matin maliet motedi gi makaa koketi but wiye kod pi e agulu. Nochiemo mometho eka bangʼe kendo nodok monindo.<verse eid="1KI 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7"/>Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye noduogo ire mar ariyo kendo nomule mowachone niya, “Chungi mondo ichiem nimar wuoth pod bor.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8"/>Kamano nochungʼ mi ochiemo kendo ometho. Kane osechiemo noyudo teko mowuotho ndalo piero angʼwen, odiechiengʼ gotieno nyaka Horeb, got mar Nyasaye. <verse eid="1KI 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9"/>Kanyo nodonjo ei rogo monindo kanyo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1KI 19:9">Jehova Nyasaye ofwenyore ne Elija</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Kendo wach Jehova Nyasaye nobirone mawachone niya, “En angʼo mitimo ka, Elija?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10"/>Nodwoko niya, “Asebedo katiyo matek ni Jehova Nyasaye Maratego. Jo-Israel osekwedo singruokni, gisemuko kende mag misengini kendo nego jonabigi gi ligangla. An kenda ema adongʼ kendo koro gidwaro nega.”<verse eid="1KI 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowacho niya, “Wuogi mondo idhi ichungi ewi got e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, nimar Jehova Nyasaye chiegni kadho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:11">Eka yamo maduongʼ makudho matek nobaro got mokeyo kite e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, to Jehova Nyasaye ne onge e yamono. Bangʼ yamono piny noyiengni, to Jehova Nyasaye ne onge e yiengni pinyno. <verse eid="1KI 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12"/>Bangʼ yiengni pinyno mach nobiro, to Jehova Nyasaye ne onge ei majno. To bangʼ majno yamo makudho mos nobiro. <verse eid="1KI 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13"/>Kane Elija owinje noumo wangʼe gi law abola mowuok oko kochungʼ e dho rogo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:13">Eka dwol nowuoyo kode kawacho niya, “En angʼo mitimo ka Elija?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14"/>Nodwoko niya, “Asebedo katiyo matek ni Jehova Nyasaye Maratego. Jo-Israel osekwedo singruokni, gisemuko kende mag misengini kendo nego jonabigi gi ligangla. An kenda ema adongʼ kendo koro gidwaro nega.”<verse eid="1KI 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Dog gi yo mane ibirogo kendo idhi e thim mar Damaski. Ka ichopo kuno, to wir Hazael mondo obed ruodh Aram. <verse eid="1KI 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16"/>Bende wir Jehu wuod Nimshi obed ruodh Israel, kendo iwir Elisha wuod Shafat ma ja-Abel Mehola mondo okaw kari kaka janabi. <verse eid="1KI 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17"/>Jehu biro nego ngʼato angʼata motony e ligangla mar Hazael kendo Elisha biro nego ngʼato angʼata motony e ligangla Jehu. <verse eid="1KI 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18"/>To kata mana sani an gi jodolo alufu abiriyo e piny Israel duto mapok okulore ne Baal, kendo ma pod olame ka nyodhe.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Luong mar Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19"/>Omiyo Elija nowuok kanyo modhi oyudo Elisha wuod shafat. Nopuro gi rwedhi motwe e jok apar gariyo kendo en owuon ema nochwado rwedhi machien. Elija nodhi machiegni kendo nobolo lawe mar abola kuome. <verse eid="1KI 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20"/>Elisha noweyo rwethe mag pur moringo koluwo bangʼ Elija. Nowachone niya, “Yie iwe ago ne wuonwa kod minwa oriti bangʼe to abiro dhiyo kodi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Elija nodwoke niya, “Dogi, en angʼo ma asetimo?”<verse eid="1KI 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21"/>Omiyo Elisha noweye modok. Nokawo rwethe mag pur moyangʼogi. Nowangʼo gik mane opurogo mondo ochwakgo ringʼo mi nomiyo ji kendo gichamo. Eka nochako wuoth moluwo bangʼ Elija kendo nobedo jakonyne.<verse eid="1KI 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Ben-Hadad omonjo Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1"/>Koro Ben-Hadad ruodh Aram nochoko jolwenje duto. Koriwore gi ruodhi piero adek gariyo man-gi farese kod geche nodhi molworo Samaria kendo omonje. <verse eid="1KI 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2"/>Nooro joote ei dala ir Ahab ruodh Israel kawacho niya, “Ma e gima Ben-Hadad wacho: <verse eid="1KI 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3"/>‘Fedha magi gi dhahabu magi gin maga kendo mondi mabeyo kod nyithindi gin maga.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4"/>To ruodh Israel nodwoke niya, “Mana kaka iwacho ruodha jaloch, An kaachiel gi mwanduna duto wan magi.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5"/>Jootego noduogo kendo mowacho niya, “Ma e gima Ben-Hadad owacho: ‘Naoro mondo akaw dhahabu magi kod fedha magi kaachiel gi mondi gi nyithindi. <verse eid="1KI 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6"/>To kiny kar sa maka ma, abiro oro jodonga mondo omany odi mar ruoth kaachiel gi ut jodongi. Gibiro kawo gimoro amora mikwano kaka gima berni.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7"/>Ruodh Israel noluongo jodongo duto mag piny mowachonegi niya, “Neuru kaka ngʼatni dwaro chandruok! Kane odwaro dhahabu maga gi fedha maga kaachiel gi monda gi nyithinda ne ok atame.”<verse eid="1KI 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8"/>Jodongo kaachiel gi ji duto nodwoke kawacho niya, “Kik iwinje kata yie kik iyie gik modwaro.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9"/>Kamano nodwoko joote mag Ben-Hadad niya, “Nyis ruodha ma jaloch kama, ‘Jatichni biro timo duto mane idwaro mokwongo, to dwaronini ok anyal.’ ” Negia gitero ni Ben-Hadad dwoko.<verse eid="1KI 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10"/>Eka Ben-Hadad nochako ooro ote machielo ni Ahab kowachone niya, “Mad nyiseche timna kata bedi ni en malit machalo nade, ka ok otieko Samaria pep molokore buru.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11"/>Ruodh Israel nodwoke niya, “Nyise kama: ‘Ngʼat morwako lepe mag lweny ok onego go siboi ka ngʼat molonyo lepe mag lweny.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12"/>Ben-Hadad nowinjo oteno ka en kaachiel gi ruodhi ne metho e hembegi mi nochiko joge niya, “Ikreuru mondo umonjgi.” Omiyo negiikore mondo gimonj dalano maduongʼ.<verse eid="1KI 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahab oloyo Ben-Hadad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13"/>To e kindeno janabi moro nobiro ir Ahab Ruodh Israel molando niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho, ‘Donge ineno jolweny mangʼenygi? Abiro chiwe e lweti kawuono kendo ibiro ngʼeyo ni An e Jehova Nyasaye.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14"/>To Ahab nopenjo niya, “To en ngʼatno mabiro timo mano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">To janabi nodwoke niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho: ‘Rowere ma jolweny mag jotend lweny mar gwenge ema biro timo mani.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Nopenjo niya, “En ngʼa mabiro chako lweny?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">To janabi nodwoke niya, “In ema ibiro timo kamano.”<verse eid="1KI 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15"/>Kamano Ahab nochiko rowere ma jotend lweny mag gwenge maromo ji mia ariyo gi piero adek gariyo. Eka nochoko jo-Israel mamoko maromo ji alufu abiriyo koriwore. <verse eid="1KI 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16"/>Negichako wuoth odiechiengʼ tir ka Ben-Hadad kod ruodhi piero adek gariyo moriwore kode ne nitie e hema metho. <verse eid="1KI 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17"/>Rowere ma jotend lweny mag gwenge nodhi mokwongo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:17">Koro Ben-Hadad nooro jombetre mane odwogone wach kama, “Jomoko biro kowuok Samaria.”<verse eid="1KI 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18"/>Nodwoko kama, “Ka gibiro gi kwe, makgiuru ka gingima; to ka gibiro ni lweny, to bende makgiuru ka gingima.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19"/>Rowere ma jotend lweny mag gwenge nowuok e dala ka jolweny luwo bangʼ-gi, <verse eid="1KI 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20"/>kendo moro ma moro nonego jadhape. Gikanyono jo-Aram noringo ka jo-Israel lawogi. To Ben-Hadad ruodh jo-Aram notony koidho farase kod joidh faresene mamoko. <verse eid="1KI 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21"/>Ruodh Israel nolawogi kendo nohinyo jo-farese kod jo-geche mi nonego jo-Aram mangʼeny.<verse eid="1KI 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22"/>Bangʼe janabi nobiro ir ruodh Israel monyise niya, “Koro jiw jolweny magi mondo ine gima onego itim nimar ruodh Aram biro monji kendo e chwiri mabiro.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23"/>E kindego jodong ruoth nongʼado rieko ni ruodh Aram nongʼadone rieko kagiwachone niya, “nyisechegi gin nyiseche gode, mano emomiyo ne gin gi teko moloyowa; to ka wakedo kodgi e pewe to adier wabiro bedo matek maloyogi. <verse eid="1KI 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24"/>To tim kama: Gol ruodhi duto e telo ni lweny kendo wilgi gi jotelo mamoko. <verse eid="1KI 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25"/>Bende nyaka ichok jolweny marom gi mago mane wawito farese kar farese mane walalo kod geche kar geche mane walalo eka mondo waked gi Israel e pewe. Eka adier wanabed matek moloyogi.” Noyie kodgi motimo kaka owinjore.<verse eid="1KI 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26"/>E chwiri maluwe Ben-Hadad nochoko jo-Aram modhi Afek mondo oked gi Israel. <verse eid="1KI 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27"/>Kane jo-Israel bende nochoki momigi gige konyruok, ne giwuok mondo girom kodgi. Jo-Israel nogoyo kambi momanyore kodgi machalo gi kweth ariyo mag diek, ka jo-Aram to nokwako pewe.<verse eid="1KI 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28"/>Ngʼat Nyasaye nobiro monyiso ruodh Israel niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho, nikech jo-Aram paro ni Jehova Nyasaye en nyasach gode to ok nyasach holni, abiro chiwo jolweny mangʼenygi e lweti kendo ibiro ngʼeyo ni an Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="1KI 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29"/>Kuom ndalo abiriyo negigoyo kambi ka gimanyore, kendo e odiechiengʼ mar abiriyo lweny norado. Jo-Israel nonego jolwenj Aram ma jotelo maromo alufu mia achiel odiechiengno. <verse eid="1KI 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30"/>Joma nodongʼ kuomgi notony modhi Afek kama ohinga nomukore monego ji alufu piero ariyo gabiriyo. To Ben-Hadad noringo modhi e dala maduongʼ mopondo ei ot maiye.<verse eid="1KI 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31"/>Jodonge nowachone niya, “Ne, wasewinjo ni ruodhi mag jo-Israel ngʼwon. Yie wadhi ir ruodh Israel ka watweyo pien gugru e nungowa kendo ka watweyo tonde e wiwa. Dipo ka okechi.”<verse eid="1KI 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32"/>Negidhi ir ruodh Israel ka girwako lep pien gugru e nungogi kendo gitweyo tonde wigi mi giwachone niya, “Jatichni Ben-Hadad wacho niya, Yie iweya abed mangima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Eka ruoth nodwoko niya, “Pod ongima? En owadwa.”<verse eid="1KI 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33"/>Jogo nokaw wachno kaka ranyisi maber kendo negikawo wachno piyo piyo ma giwacho niya, “Ee, owadu Ben-Hadad!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Ruoth nowachonigi niya, “Dhiuru mondo uome.” Kane Ben-Hadad osewuok oko, Ahab noluongo mondo oidh gache.<verse eid="1KI 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34"/>Ben-Hadad noyie mowachone niya, “Abiro dwoko mier mane wuonwa okawo kuom wuonu.” Inyalo keto chirni magu uwuon Damaski mana kaka wuonwa notimo Samaria.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Ahab nodwoke niya, “Kuom winjruok ma wabiro timo abiro weyi mondo idhi.” Kuom mano notimo kode winjruok moweye odhi.<verse eid="1KI 20:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Janabi okwongʼo Ahab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35"/>Kuom wach Jehova Nyasaye achiel kuom yawuot jonabi nowacho ni wadgi niya, “Goya gi gir lwenji mitingʼo,” to ngʼatno notamore.<verse eid="1KI 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36"/>Kamano janabi nowacho niya, “Nikech ok isewinjo dwond Jehova Nyasaye, mapiyo piyo kiwuok ka, to sibuor biro negi.” Kendo bangʼ ka ngʼatno nosea, sibuor noyude monege.<verse eid="1KI 20:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37"/>Janabino noyudo ngʼat machielo mowachone niya, “Kiyie to goya.” Kamano ngʼatno nogoye mohinye. <verse eid="1KI 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38"/>Eka janabino nodhi mochungʼ e bath yo korito ruoth. Noumo wangʼe gi kilemba mar wiye mondo kik fweny ni en ngʼa. <verse eid="1KI 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39"/>Kane ruoth kadho kanyo janabi noluonge mowachone niya, “Jatichni nodhi e chuny lweny, kendo ngʼato nobiro ira gi misumba momaki mowachona ni, ‘Rit ngʼatni kolal to ngimani biro chulo ngimane kata ibiro chulo fedha maromo kilo piero adek gangʼwen.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40"/>Kane jatijno odich ka gi kacha ngʼatno nolal.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Ruodh Israel nodwoke niya, “Mano e bura mongʼadni nikech isewache iwuon.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41"/>Eka janabi nogolo kilemba mane ogengʼogo wangʼe mi ruodh jo-Israel nofwenye kaka achiel kuom jonabi. <verse eid="1KI 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42"/>Nowacho ni ruoth niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye owacho: ‘Iseweyo ngʼat mane awacho ni nyaka tho odhi thuolo. Kuom mano inichul ngimane gi ngimani kendo jogi kuom joge.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43"/>Ruodh Israel nodhi e ode mar ruoth Samaria ka chunye orumo kendo ka iye owangʼ kod mirima.<verse eid="1KI 20:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Puoth Naboth mar mzabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1"/>Bangʼ kinde moko wach nowuok momako puoth mzabibu mar Naboth ja-Jezreel, puoth mzabibuno ne nitie Jezreel, machiegni gi dala ruoth maduongʼ mar Ahab ma ruodh Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2"/>Ahab nowachone Naboth niya, “Yie akaw puothi mar mzabibu alok puoth alot nikech ochiegni gi dalana maduongʼ. To kar puodhono abiro miyi puoth mzabibu maber moloyo, to bende ka ihero to anachuli gimoro amora midwaro.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3"/>To Naboth nodwoke niya, “Jehova Nyasaye ok dibed mamor kade amiyi puodho ma en mwandu kwerena.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4"/>Omiyo Ahab nodok dala kokuyo kendo ka iye owangʼ nikech Naboth ja-Jezreel nodwoke niya, “Ok anamiyi gir mwandu mar kwerena.” Nonindo e kitandane ka oparore kendo notamore chiemo.<verse eid="1KI 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5"/>Jaode Jezebel nobiro ire e ot mopenje niya, “En angʼo momiyo ikuyo? En angʼo momoni chiemo?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6"/>Nodwoke niya, “Nikech nawacho ni Naboth ja-Jezreel ni, ‘Yie iusna puothi mar mzabibu; to ka ok kamano, to anyalo miyi puoth mzabibu machielo kare.’ En to nodwoke ni, ‘Ok anamiyi puotha mar mzabibu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7"/>Jezebel jaode to nowachone niya, “Bende e kaka onego itimri to in e ruoth mar Israel? Aa malo kendo ichiem! Bed mamor. Abiro miyi puoth mzabibu mar Naboth ja-Jezreel.”<verse eid="1KI 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8"/>Omiyo nondiko barupe kotiyo gi nying Ahab moketo kido mar ruoth kuomgi kendo mi oorgi ir jodongo kod joka ruoth mane odak kode e dala maduongʼ mar Naboth. <verse eid="1KI 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9"/>E barupego nondikoe kama:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 21:9">“Luonguru odiechieng tweyo chiemo kendo keturu Naboth obed piny e nyim ji kama oyiedhi. <verse eid="1KI 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10"/>To keturu joma timbegi mono ariyo momanyore kode kendo ketgiuru mondo gihangne wach ni osekwongʼo Nyasaye kod ruoth. Eka ugole oko kendo uchiele gi kite nyaka otho.”<verse eid="1KI 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11"/>Omiyo jodongo kod joka ruoth mane odak e dala maduongʼ mar Naboth notimo kaka Jezebel nochikogi e barupego mane osendikonigi. <verse eid="1KI 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12"/>Negilando chiengʼ tweyo chiemo kendo negiketo Naboth obet piny e nyim ji kama oyiedhi. <verse eid="1KI 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13"/>Eka ji ariyo ma timbegi mono nobiro mobedo momanyore kode e nyim ji, mohangone wach kawacho niya, “Naboth osekwongʼo Nyasaye gi ruoth.” Omiyo ne gigole oko mar dala mi gigoye gi kite ma otho. <verse eid="1KI 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14"/>Eka negioro ni Jezebel wach kama, “Naboth osego gi kite motho.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15"/>Mapiyo piyo ka Jezebel nowinjo ni Naboth osego gi kite motho, nonyiso Ahab niya, “Aa malo mondo ikaw puoth mzabibu mar Naboth ja-Jezreel, mane odagi usoni, ok ongima, osetho.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16"/>Kane Ahab owinjo ni Naboth osetho, noa malo modhi mondo okaw puoth Naboth mar mzabibu obed mare.<verse eid="1KI 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17"/>Eka wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ni Elija ja-Tishbi: <verse eid="1KI 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18"/>“Dhiyo mondo irom gi Ahab ruodh Israel molocho Samaria. Koro entie e puoth Naboth mar mzabibu mosedhiye mondo okaw obed mare. <verse eid="1KI 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19"/>Nyise kama, ‘Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho, Donge isenego ngʼato kendo mikawo mwandune?’ Wachne kendo ni, ‘Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho, Kama guogi nonangʼoe remb Naboth, bende e kama guogi biro nangʼoe rembi in iwuon, ee, mana in!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20"/>Ahab nowacho ni Elija niya, “Kamano iseyuda in jasika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">To Elija nodwoke niya, “Ee, aseyudi nikech isechiwori mar timo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="1KI 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21"/>Abiro kelo masira kuomi. Abiro tieko nyikwayi kendo abiro ngʼado oko nyathi moro amora ma wuowi ma chogo moa dhood Ahab e piny Israel; bed ni gin wasumbini kata ok gin wasumbini. <verse eid="1KI 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22"/>Abiro loko odi kaka mar Jeroboam wuod Nebat gi kaka mar Baasha wuod Ahija nikech isemiya mirima kendo isemiyo Israel otimo richo.”<verse eid="1KI 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23"/>Kendo kuom Jezebel Jehova Nyasaye nowacho kama, guogi biro kidho Jezebel e tie ohinga mar Jezreel.<verse eid="1KI 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24"/>“Guogi biro chamo joka Ahab motho e mier madongo kendo winy mae kor polo biro chamo mago motho e pewe.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25"/>Ne onge ngʼat moro machielo machalo gi Ahab, mane ochiwore ni timo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kijiwe e timo kamano gi jaode Jezebel. <verse eid="1KI 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26"/>Timbene ne richoe moloyo koluwo bangʼ nyiseche mamoko, mana kaka jo-Amor mane Jehova Nyasaye oriembo e nyim jo-Israel.<verse eid="1KI 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27"/>Kane Ahab owinjo wechegi duto, noyiecho lepe, morwako lep gunia kendo notweyo chiemo. Nonindo gi lepe mag guniago kendo nowuotho kokuyo.<verse eid="1KI 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28"/>Eka wach Jehova Nyasaye nobiro ni Elija ja-Tishbi, kawacho niya, <verse eid="1KI 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29"/>“Bende isefwenyo kaka sani Ahab osebolore e nyima? Nikech osebolore, ok anakel masirani e ndalone, to abiro kele e ode e kinde mag wuode.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Mikaya okoro Ahab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1"/>Kuom higni adek ne onge lweny e kind Israel gi Aram <verse eid="1KI 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2"/>To e higa mar adek Jehoshafat ruodh Juda nodhi neno ruodh Israel. <verse eid="1KI 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3"/>Ruodh Israel nosenyiso jodonge niya, “Donge ungʼeyo ni Ramoth Gilead en marwa to onge gima watimo mondo wakawe kuom ruodh Aram?”<verse eid="1KI 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4"/>Omiyo nopenjo Jehoshafat, “Ibiro dhi konya kedo gi jo-Ramoth Gilead?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Jehoshafat nodwoko ruodh Israel niya, “Wan joka ngʼato achiel, joga gin jogi, faresena gin fareseni.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5"/>To Jehoshafat bende nowachone ruodh Israel niya, “Mokwongo penj ane Jehova Nyasaye wachni.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6"/>Omiyo ruodh Israel nochoko jonabi kanyakla maromo ji mia angʼwen, mopenjogi niya, “Bende anyalo dhi kedo gi jo-Ramoth Gilead, koso kik adhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Negidwoke niya “Dhiyo nikech Jehova Nyasaye nochiwe e lwet ruoth.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7"/>To Jehoshafat nopenjo niya, “Donge nitie janabi mar Jehova Nyasaye ka ma dwapenj wach?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8"/>Ruodh Israel nodwoko Jehoshafat niya, “Pod nitie ngʼato achiel manyalo penjonwa Jehova Nyasaye wach, to ok adware nikech ok okor gimoro amora maber kuoma, to kinde duto mana gik maricho. Nyinge en Mikaya wuod Imla.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Jehoshafat nodwoko niya, “Ruoth ok onego iwach kamano.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9"/>Omiyo ruodh Israel noluongo achiel kuom jodonge mowachone niya, “Dhi piyo iom Mikaya wuod Imla.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10"/>Ruodh Israel kod Jehoshafat ruodh Juda noyudo orwako lepgi mag ruoth ka moro ka moro kuomgi obet e kom duongʼne e kar dino cham mantie e dhoranga Samaria, kendo ne gin kod jonabi duto mane koro e nyimgi. <verse eid="1KI 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11"/>Koro Zedekia wuod Kenana noloso tunge mag nyinyo kolando niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye owacho, ‘Gi chumbegi ibiro chwowo jo-Aram nyaka itiekgi chuth.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12"/>Jonabi mamoko duto bende ne koro wach mana machal kamano. Negiwacho niya, “Monj jo-Ramoth Gilead kendo ilogi nikech Jehova Nyasaye enokete e lwet ruoth.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13"/>Jaote mane odhi luongo Mikaya nowachone niya “Jonabi duto osekoro wach achiel machalre, kagiwacho ni gima ber biro timore ni ruoth. In bende yie ikor wach maber kaka gisekorono.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14"/>To Mikaya nowacho niya, “Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni, anyalo mana nyise gima Jehova Nyasaye owachona.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15"/>Kane Mikaya ochopo, ruoth nopenje niya, “Bende wanyalo dhi mondo waked gi jo-Ramoth Gilead, koso kik wadhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Nodwoke niya, “Ked kodgi kendo iyud loch nimar Jehova Nyasaye osechiwe e lwet ruoth.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16"/>Ruoth nowachone niya, “Nyaka karangʼo ma anaketi mondo ikwongʼrina gi nying Jehova Nyasaye ni iwacho adiera ma ok miriambo?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17"/>Eka Mikaya nodwoke niya, “Ne aneno jo-Israel duto koke ewi gode mana kaka rombe maonge jakwath, kendo Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ni, ‘Jogi onge gi ruoth. Yie iwe ngʼato ka ngʼato odhi e dalane gi kwe.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18"/>Ruodh Israel nowachone Jehoshafat niya, “Donge nawachoni ni ok okorna gik mabeyo, to okoro mana gik maricho?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19"/>Mikaya nodhi nyime kawacho niya, “Kuom mano winj wach Jehova Nyasaye: Naneno Jehova Nyasaye kobet e kom duongʼne gi jopolo duto kochungʼ molwore, e bade korachwich kendo e bade koracham. <verse eid="1KI 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20"/>Kendo Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ni, ‘En ngʼa mabiro hoyo Ahab mondo oked gi jo-Ramoth Gilead kendo onege kuno?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:20">“To ngʼato ka ngʼato nochiwo pache. <verse eid="1KI 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21"/>Mogik, roho marach nobiro mochungʼ e nyim Jehova Nyasaye mowacho ni, ‘Abiro hoye.’<verse eid="1KI 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22"/>“Jehova Nyasaye nopenje niya, ‘Ere kaka ibiro hoye?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">“Nodwoke niya, ‘Abiro dhi mondo abed roho mar miriambo e dho jonabi mage duto.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">“Jehova Nyasaye nodwoke niya, ‘Dhiyo kendo itim kamano nikech in ema ibiro hoye mi iloye.’<verse eid="1KI 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23"/>“Omiyo koro sani Jehova Nyasaye oseketo roho mar miriambo e dho jonabigi duto. Jehova Nyasaye osengʼadoni buch masira.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24"/>Eka Zedekia wuod Kenana noa malo mopamo lemb Mikaya. Nopenje niya, “En yo mane ma Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye noluwo kobiro wuoyo kodi?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25"/>Mikaya nodwoke niya, “Ibiro fwenyo chiengʼ ma iniring kidhi pondo e ot maiye.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26"/>Ruodh Israel nogolo chik niya, “Kawuru Mikaya kendo utere ir Amon jatend dala maduongʼ kendo ir Joash wuod ruoth, <verse eid="1KI 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27"/>kendo uwachne ni, ‘Gima ruoth wacho ema: Ket ngʼatni e od twech kendo kik imiye gimoro amora makmana makati kod pi nyaka aduogi kangima.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28"/>Mikaya nowachone niya, “Kidwogo kingima, to kara ok asewuoyo gi dho Jehova Nyasaye.” Bangʼe nomedo wacho niya, “Winjuru wechena, un ji duto!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oneg Ahab e piny Ramoth Gilead</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29"/>Omiyo ruodh Israel gi Jehoshafat ruodh Juda nodhi Ramoth Gilead. <verse eid="1KI 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30"/>Ruodh Israel nowachone Jehoshafat niya, “Abiro rwako lewni moko ka wadhi e lweny mondo kik gifwenya, in to rwak arwaka lepi mag ruoth.” Omiyo ruodh Israel norwako lewni ma ok nyal fwenyego kendo nodhi e lweny.<verse eid="1KI 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31"/>Ruodh jo-Aram nogolo chik ne jotende piero adek gariyo mariembo geche niya, “Kik uked gi ngʼato angʼata bed ni otin kata oduongʼ makmana ruodh Israel.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32"/>Kane jotelo mariembo geche lweny noneno Jehoshafat negiwacho e chunygi niya, “Adier ma en ruodh Israel.” Omiyo negilokore mondo giked kode, to kane Jehoshafat oywak, <verse eid="1KI 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33"/>jotelo mariembo geche lweny noneno ni ok en ruodh Israel mi negiweyo lawe.<verse eid="1KI 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34"/>To ngʼat moro noywayo atungʼ mare modiro asere ma nochwowo ruodh Israel e kind law lweny mane orwako. Ruoth nonyiso jariemb gache niya, “Lok garini mondo igola ka, nimar ahinyora marach.” <verse eid="1KI 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35"/>Odiechiengʼno duto lweny nomedo bedo mager kendo noten ruoth e gache komanyore gi jo-Aram. Remo mane chwer kawuok kama nohinyore nopongʼo i gari, kendo godhiambo notho. <verse eid="1KI 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36"/>Kane ochopo podho chiengʼ ywak nowinjore e kind jolweny niya, ngʼato ka ngʼato odog e gwengʼ-gi kendo ngʼato ka ngʼato odog e pinygi.<verse eid="1KI 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37"/>Kamano ruoth notho kendo nokele Samaria moike kanyo. <verse eid="1KI 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38"/>Ne gilwoko garino e yawo moro Samaria (kama ochode lwokoree), kendo guogi nonangʼo rembe, mana kaka wach Jehova Nyasaye nosewacho.<verse eid="1KI 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39"/>Timbe mamoko mag loch Ahab kaachiel gi gik moko duto mane otimo, gi dala ruoth maduongʼ mane ogero mobawo gi lak liech kod mier mane ochielo gi ohinga, donge ondikgi e kitap rapar mar ruodhi Israel? <verse eid="1KI 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40"/>Ahab noyweyo gi kwerene, kendo Ahazia wuode nokawo lochne kaka ruoth.<verse eid="1KI 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoshafat ruodh Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41"/>Jehoshafat wuod Asa nodoko ruodh Juda e higa mar angʼwen mar Ahab ruodh Israel. <verse eid="1KI 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42"/>Jehoshafat ne ja-higni piero adek gabich kane obedo ruoth kendo norito piny kodak Jerusalem kuom higni piero adek gabich. Min mare ne nyinge Azuba nyar Shilhi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43"/>E gik moko duto noluwo yore Asa wuon mare kendo ne ok oweyogi, nimar notimo gima kare e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. To kata kamano kuonde motingʼore gi malo mag lemo ne ok omuki kendo ji nodhi nyime mana gi chiwo misengini kendo wangʼo ubani. <verse eid="1KI 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44"/>Jehoshafat bende ne nigi kwe gi ruodh Israel.<verse eid="1KI 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45"/>Gik mamoko manotimore ndalo loch Jehoshafat gi gik mane otimo kaachiel gi humbe lwenjene, donge ondikgi e kitepe rapar mar ruodhi Juda? <verse eid="1KI 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46"/>Noriembo jochode machwo mane ni kuonde motingʼore mag lemo mane otony e ndalo mag loch wuon-gi Asa. <verse eid="1KI 22:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47"/>E kindeno ne onge ruoth e piny Edom, jalupne ema ne ni e loch.<verse eid="1KI 22:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48"/>Koro Jehoshafat nohondho yiedhi mag ohala mondo odhi Ofir oom dhahabu to kata kamano ne ok gikwangʼ nikech ne gikethore kama iluongo ni Ezion Geber. <verse eid="1KI 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49"/>E kindeno Ahazia wuod Ahab nowacho ni Jehoshafat niya, “Yie iwe joga okwangʼ gi jogi, to Jehoshafat nodagi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50"/>Jehoshafat notho kaka kwerene kendo noyike but kwerene e dala maduongʼ mar Daudi wuon-gi. Kendo Jehoram wuode nobedo ruoth kare.<verse eid="1KI 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahazia ruodh Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51"/>Ahazia wuod Ahab nobedo ruodh Israel e Samaria e higa mar apar gabiriyo mar loch Jehoshafat ruodh Juda, kendo nobedo ruodh Israel higni ariyo. <verse eid="1KI 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52"/>Notimo richo e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nikech nowuotho e yore mag wuon-gi gi min-gi kendo e yore mag Jeroboam wuod Nebat mane omiyo Israel otimo richo. <verse eid="1KI 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53"/>Notiyo ni Baal kendo nolame mi nomiyo Jehova Nyasaye, Nyasach Israel, obedo gi mirima mana kaka wuon-gi nosetimo.<verse eid="1KI 22:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22"/>
</usx>
